{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":79743,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that IzzyDeee mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1892981\n\n----------------------------------\nIt was a great time [emoji1] @\"calgarybride2015\" \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1426462827","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1428954332,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79735,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMeandhim just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nbahahahah!!!!! Love it!\n \nI went to the wax museum in Vegas!! was a nice experience, this was before Obama's time though (I think)... I am Canadian, go easy on me!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1892976\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428952358,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79734,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Meandhim mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1892979\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"calgarybride2015\" thanks! I draw all day at work so I don't consider that being crafty... You my friend ARE crazy crafty!  All your DIY's were amazing and inspiring...and I'm sure you will see a few of your ideas copied here!! \n\nI haven't completely nailed down the guestbook yet but postcards are high on the list so far thanks to you. I'm definitely making postcards but I might just put them in the welcome bags if I come up with another idea for my guest book.\n\nI've had a ton of original ideas until I joined here and then realized someone else did it already.. Lol\n\nAs for the dresses I'm trying not to watch say yes to the dress or any other wedding show \/ magazine... It just sets in the doubt. I'm sure my dress is fine and once the time comes and everything is together it'll be great!\n\nI know the 7 months are going to fly by and as I mentioned above and you can probably tell by my few posts I'm a total procrastinator! I'm terrified I'm going to have too much left til the end...current goal get legal stuff sorted SOON, before the end of April. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428952271,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79730,"Title":"liked a post you made in Meandhim - Grand Palladium...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMeandhim just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nGreat update!\n \nI personally love both of your dresses!!!  Sometimes it's hard not to think of others or want to look for others, I would recommend reminding yourself why you chose those in the first place to help you thru those times of regret. I would also suggest you p...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1892971\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428951406,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79669,"Title":"liked a post you made in David's Bridal Bridesma...","Message":"Hello!\n\nLaurenC3432 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHey!I got my wedding dress and 3 bridesmaids dresses from David's Bridal. All came in WAY under the stated time. For my dress they told me about 3 months and it was maybe 6 weeks. For their dresses it was 12 weeks (new color and nothing in stock) and maybe 2 months at best.  My experience was g...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79048-davids-bridal-bridesmaid-dresses-question\/?view=findpost&p=1892800\n","Sender":{"Id":281421,"Name":"LaurenC3432","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428936252,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79517,"Title":"liked a post you made in New Bdw Mobile App For Both...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI will ASAP! This new update on tap a talk is kind of annoying lol Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79055-new-bdw-mobile-app-for-both-ios-and-android\/?view=findpost&p=1892885\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428877231,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79516,"Title":"liked a post you made in New Bdw Mobile App For Both...","Message":"Hello!\n\nAlexBrecher just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI will ASAP! This new update on tap a talk is kind of annoying lol Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79055-new-bdw-mobile-app-for-both-ios-and-android\/?view=findpost&p=1892885\n","Sender":{"Id":282720,"Name":"AlexBrecher","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282720.jpg?_r=1428960385","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428876990,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79489,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"calgarybride2015,\n\nacw271011 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"First aid kits\".\n\nacw271011 said:\n======================================================================\nWe have a big new Dollarama not far away so I may take a look and see. We have such a small group that I'm not sure it's worth bothering with too much and I need to watch I don't get carried away for nothing. I definitely want to do a couple of travel meds that will be useful in Mexico - pepto, advil, Imodium, etc but I think that's it. I still have such a long time yet it feels silly doing stuff. I really need to wait a while. I have tests to do in September and as much as the doctor says it's just a formality and there shouldn't be anything wrong, I still worry that it's the one thing that could mess everything up again!!\n \nAll these young ladies going off to get married now. They feel like my girls lol Silly I know but after watching them plan for so long, to have their weddings all so close now, I know we'll be losing girls from the site once they're married.\n \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9343&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428870667,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9343},{"Id":79462,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/73939-las-diy-blog\/page-6\n \nThis is where I saw that idea (I went back and found the page!) It's at the very bottom of the pa...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1892855\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428866863,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79458,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"calgarybride2015,\n\nacw271011 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"First aid kits\".\n\nacw271011 said:\n======================================================================\nReally? What's in them? Did you get any for your bags? I only need a couple but I thought it might be a good idea. I've never seen them before. But I'm realizing what a sheltered life I've led!!! lol\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9343&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428865479,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9343},{"Id":79378,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that TinkerSofi mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1892827\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nI totally love #2 lol Could you ad a touch of colour to #1? Make it pop a little bit? Love the design and the font together. Looks great!\n \nlol I did check out the shoes and saw the light blue! They're gorgeous!! Believe me, i thought about it for about a second lol I wouldn't do that to you! But they really are gorgeous!! I'm hoping to find a bright blue if I can and hopefully with some sparkle similar to yours! Let the search begin! lol\n-----------------------------\n\nYou should totally get them! I really don't mind. It's not like we're going to be wearing them at the same time <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> and they're so beautiful. Originally I also wanted  to have royal blue shoes but I couldn't find any that weren't super high and then eventually I just decided to go for silver\/champagne. Then I found the pink ones and I fell in love <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\n \nI just remembered something about the signs, with our package for the tables we get these menus that are in periwinkle and blush pink. I'll see if I can recreate something different. Juan will not like this because he'll say \"i thought we had made a decision already\" haha. I just always have to keep trying. \n \n\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nI love the first guestbook (#1) <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n-----------------------------\n\nThanks! That's the one Juan liked too. I'll head to the dollar stores and wal-mart today to see if I can find any frameless picture frames to put them in so they're not blowing all over the place. I also have to make the same sign saying photobooth and to indicate for people to find their fans. \n \n@\"calgarybride2015\" I love the saying that you put up there about \"Stay cool, be cool\" (oops, sorry it was \"to stay cool, to make you cool\" haha) I really want to use it. Now my dilemma is, the fans will have the person's name and their table number for the reception, but they'll be getting them during the ceremony. Do you think it would be confusing if you pick up your fan and it says XXX table 1 but there are no tables, or is it pretty self-explanatory? Should I add a sign about it? I always think things are kind of common sense but apparently common sense is the least common sense of all <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>. Or should I just think of a new seating chart all together? \n \nI honestly can't talk with anyone else about these little silly things because everyone says \"you're overplanning\". Maybe I am, but I need to know these things! haha. You guys understand though. \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428834632,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79336,"Title":"liked a post you made in Our Dw: Dreams Riviera Canc...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"veryvalentine\" data-cid=\"1892605\" data-time=\"1428670779\">@   your posts always amaze me!  ziplock bags and plastic shoe containers!! of course!!  Wow, so organized.  I lvoe that you wrote the instructions for setup on the ziplock bags.pdccmc  S...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1892606\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428791977,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79333,"Title":"liked a post you made in Our Dw: Dreams Riviera Canc...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"kcole123\" data-cid=\"1892569\" data-time=\"1428634478\">@ Listen girl I totally get your panic...lol I am sitting here tonight looking at packing and don't even know where to start. I keep walking in the room and two seconds later I walk back out, t...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1892572\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428791320,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79326,"Title":"liked a post you made in Our Dw: Dreams Riviera Canc...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI know it's tough but try not to cry. Our week called for rain too and it rained once over night. Mexico rain isn't the same as our rain. It can down pour for 5-10 min hard then it's gone. I know sometimes people get rained out but chances are higher for sunshine. Try not to stress about this as...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1892567\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428789709,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79324,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that TinkerSofi mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1892814\n\n----------------------------------\nJuan decided on #1 as well <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> so #1 it is. You ladies are right @\"calgarybride2015\" @snswedding2016 , the more I looked at it the more I felt like it was the best fitting one for the wedding. I love chevron but it's kinda late now to incorporate it and I have nothing else that goes with it. The frame on the black sign actually also goes really well with some little swirls I had on the invitations. \n \nI will definitely miss the planning but I think more than the planning itself I'll miss the projects. I've started stashing a bunch of sewing projects to get into after all this is done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. Maybe I can also learn a new type of dance when all my money isn't being sucked into the wedding haha. \n \nWe finished stencilling our OOT bags today! yay! It was the first time Juan helped me out with them and all he'd say at first was \"wow this is so much work\" \"why don't we just send them to get printed\" \"I can't believe I agreed to this\". This is the guy who asked me not to finish all of them because he wanted to help. I basically told him to either shut up and help or leave me to it haha so then he got into it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>. \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428789610,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79314,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nNow that I've seen your tables again I vote #1 all the way!! It's way more vintage than the chevron pattern. Just my 2 cents. Man I miss planning <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> but on the flip side I don't heheSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1892792\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428788964,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79228,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that TinkerSofi mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1892775\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\n@\"TinkerSofi\"\n \nYea I'm really looking forward to the first look now. I agree I think with everything going on for the ceremony it will be nice to have a private moment captured by our photographer.  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n \nI LOVE the new sections of AF that everyone is posting on Facebook for photos - they look gorgeous!! We're pretty sure we're going to do the BDR in Sept so we're trying to arrange to meet our photographers and do a walk through of spots we want to take photos. \n \nFor photos after the ceremony I would recommend designating someone (maybe a bridesmaid) to run your group photos. I've done this for several friend's weddings and it really helps speed everything up. You basically just have one person with the 'shot list' getting everyone organized and making sure that the photographer has who they need and the next group is waiting and ready.  My photographer also made a good point - he said you can always get group photos with your guests at the reception but you don't really want to lost the light for photos with you and your hubby\u2026after all those are the pics that are going to be up in your house. \n \nI totally get you about writing your own vows. It's not for everyone and you definitely want Juan to be comfortable for your ceremony. Sean was the opposite, I tentatively asked if he wanted to write our own vows and he was like \"hell ya!\" LOL! I've always wanted to write my own as well but now I'm nervous I'm just going to be a hot mess trying to get through them. haha. I'm definitely going to have to practice them a lot!\n-----------------------------\n\n \nI think that's a great tip! @\"calgarybride2015\" I remember you mentioning that this helped so much, to have a list of people that you needed to take pictures with. It's is now on my \"to do\" list <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. The first look is looking more and more likely. I'll talk it over with Juan today again but I know he'll say yes since we already discussed it and he had liked the idea <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. He actually even preferred it because we'd look nice and fresh on our pictures. I was the one that wasn't sure so much. \n \nI do like doing presentations so I know that saying my vows, even though I'd be nervous, I'd be able to get through it. Juan is not so much of a public speaker, so I know he'd suffer through it haha. He just had his presentation for the final project at school and he said it was the worst <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>. I know he was surrounded by strangers but he's just not the type to like the spotlight on him. \n \nIf you can do the BDR do it! I kind of wish I had because now I feel like I'm going into this totally blind. At the time the finances didn't add up to go, and by the time we could have gone it would have been like 2 months before the wedding, so no point. The good thing is that we have quite a few days before the wedding to scope things out and hopefully be familiar with the resort by then. \n \n \n\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nHey lady,\n \nIf your sunsets at 7:19pm, it will be dark by then. So if you want a good hour to hour and a half for photos, you should bump your ceremony time up, if even only by 30 minutes.\n \nI had budgeted 1.5 hours for mine, and we didn't need it all but I thank that in part to a couple things...\n1. the ceremony did not take 30 mins, 15 mins is pushing it\n2. I had my MC (brother in law) in charge of the toast and group\/family photos. He knew we wanted to move everything along - we did have some hugging and thank yous. He then gave a super quick toast and started to 'order' everyone around with the list I had provided him of the shots we wanted, this kept things moving. Had we not have had him, it would have been a stressful time and delayed things immensely.  \n \nLOVE LOVE those shoes, nice choice.\n \nEDIT:  We had a rehearsal dinner with long tables and it really made things tough to talk. You only talk to the 4 or 5 people around you. So for a welcome event I would probably suggest impromptu drinks and to use the included dinner for the rehearsal.   Or, as someone else said above, had the impromptu drinks before the welcome dinner so atleast everyone mingles before sitting at those long tables.  We an impromptu drinks at the lobby, while it was loud and hard to do formal introductions I introduced everyone personally and people just mingled, worked well.\n-----------------------------\n\nI can't wait for those shoes to arrive! I really like the first ones I got, but I absolutely LOVE these ones haha <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.\n \nThank you for the photography tips. I wasn't sure how much light you have \"at sunset\", I was comparing it to here and how at sunset there's still some light so you could take some cool looking pictures, but I think it's different over there. I'm sure glad I mentioned it here, you guys have been super helpful <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>. We also want a short ceremony, Juan doesn't want it to go over 15 min.  \n \nApparently there's this one bar over there that doesn't have a lot of people, they have tequila testing there <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> and it's a Mexican themed place. If it's quiet I think it'd work perfectly for mingling with everyone. Most people have at least seen each other at some point at one of the parties we'd had so they're not total strangers. Now I'm getting super excited!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428746563,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79225,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nsnswedding2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHey lady,\n \nIf your sunsets at 7:19pm, it will be dark by then. So if you want a good hour to hour and a half for photos, you should bump your ceremony time up, if even only by 30 minutes.\n \nI had budgeted 1.5 hours for mine, and we didn't need it all but I th...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1892770\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1428746147,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79221,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHey lady,\n \nIf your sunsets at 7:19pm, it will be dark by then. So if you want a good hour to hour and a half for photos, you should bump your ceremony time up, if even only by 30 minutes.\n \nI had budgeted 1.5 hours for mine, and we didn't need it all but I th...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1892770\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428745510,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79182,"Title":"liked a post you made in Kcole123 Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nSome banks even offer USD thru their ATMs. I know RBC does. Yes $2000 in one go may be hard but an option. tD will be open, I don't think they ever close heheSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78626-kcole123-planning-thread-april-17-2015-melia-caribe-tropical\/?view=findpost&p=1892753\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428711137,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79087,"Title":"liked a post you made in New Venue Opening Soon, Hya...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nOn Hyatt's website when you go to book there is a link for all inclusive, so I'm sure it is.  It's just odd that on Hyatt's page for this PDC site it doesn't mention AI anywhere. Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79046-new-venue-opening-soon-hyatt-playa-del-carmen\/?view=findpost&p=1892718\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428699315,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79076,"Title":"liked a post you made in Perianjay Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nAwe, everything you have there is gorgeous!\nLove both shoes - wish I could wear heals like those, they are sexy!!\n \nGood job on the deals!! It's all coming together. I love living thru all of you now <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1892654\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428693156,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79061,"Title":"liked a post you made in New Venue Opening Soon, Hya...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWhat I found odd is that on the Hyatt website it doesn't even mention all inclusive anywhere.  Maybe try to book thru their website and see if you can make headway there. Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79046-new-venue-opening-soon-hyatt-playa-del-carmen\/?view=findpost&p=1892712\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428692021,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79009,"Title":"liked a post you made in Perianjay Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nAwe, everything you have there is gorgeous!\nLove both shoes - wish I could wear heals like those, they are sexy!!\n \nGood job on the deals!! It's all coming together. I love living thru all of you now <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1892654\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428678780,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78992,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that beckys98 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76758-budgeting-for-tips-how-much\/?view=findpost&p=1892682\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"calgarybride2015\" It isn't actually even the vendor fees! We're using the preferred DJ and our photographer is covering the vendor fee. But the DJ is $190 per hour and the photographer is $2,500...not exactly cheap even by Chicago standards. (Those are our only outside vendors.)\n \nHe isn't anti-tipping in general. He is from Jamaica so he likes to support Jamaicans and the Jamaican economy, but that also means he knows how far an American dollar goes in Jamaica, so he just has more modest dollar amounts in mind than what I had in the budget <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428672137,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78976,"Title":"liked a post you made in Social Media And Your Weddi...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"veryvalentine\" data-cid=\"1892602\" data-time=\"1428669947\">I'm torn on this one.  Given that friends can't see anything on my FB unless I allow it on my 'timeline' I'm going to make sure that Groomzillo also does the same thing.  I don't think th...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77767-social-media-and-your-wedding-day\/?view=findpost&p=1892607\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428669132,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78960,"Title":"liked a post you made in Veryvalero's Wedding Pl...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nTry not to feel bad. I ordered the dress size I had on in the store. Fit like a glove.  When I went back to look at BM dresses I tried it on again and it was almost big!   Well fast forward to when my dress came in -- barely did up <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>  then they told me it wasn't stretched like the ones in store...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/?view=findpost&p=1892417\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428666663,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78930,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1892665\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"SteeleTheSpotlight\" that's where I got mine from as well <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> - Smiling Tag\n \n@\"calgarybride2015\" Thanks! It's not often that I wear heels, so I wanted to get some sexy strappy ones! haha\n \n@veryvalero that's so awesome!! haha.. I didn't give my girls a choice. Whoops. I just ordered them in the powder pink and I got myself one in the white (even though I already have a bride robe). I did it because if I got the 5th one it was basically like I got it free anyway with the bulk price.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428663484,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78924,"Title":"liked a post you made in Perianjay Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nAwe, everything you have there is gorgeous!\nLove both shoes - wish I could wear heals like those, they are sexy!!\n \nGood job on the deals!! It's all coming together. I love living thru all of you now <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1892654\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428663357,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78907,"Title":"liked a post you made in Perianjay Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nAwe, everything you have there is gorgeous!\nLove both shoes - wish I could wear heals like those, they are sexy!!\n \nGood job on the deals!! It's all coming together. I love living thru all of you now <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1892654\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428658656,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"1152","TotalPages":39,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":1140},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":3,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
