rter.net<\/a>) and I will gladly update the thread.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">The old <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/57821\/the-now-riviera-cancun' class='bbc_url' title=''><span  style=\"color: #008080\">NOW<\/span><\/a><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/57821\/the-now-riviera-cancun' class='bbc_url' title=''><span  style=\"color: #008080\"> Jade Thread<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"> is still alive and active, but hopefully that thread will be more for brides to discuss their weddings and form a sense of community.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Thanks!<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif;color: rgb(24,24,24);font-size: 10pt\">* edited to add attachment of NOW Jade Resort Pictures<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif;color: rgb(24,24,24);font-size: 10pt\">** Please note, the information in this thread and on BDW has not been verified and is not guaranteed. \u00a0The resort may change their wedding packages, pricing, details, etc. at any time without giving notice. <u><strong>\u00a0This information is just to be used as a guideline and not as a contract of what the resort or BDW guarantees.<\/strong><\/u> \u00a0When you are ready to book and sign a contract with the resort, you will need to rely on the information they have given you.<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1171995300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1392116614,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b00044eae223f10f375558ec8c9658c1","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Overall Coordinator is Pilar Gonzalez \/ Groups &amp;amp; Convention Manager&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Pilar - &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:weddings.nojrc@nowresorts.com&#039;&gt;weddings.nojrc@nowresorts.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;01152-998-872-8888 ext 4006&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.nowresorts.com\/jade&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#008080;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Resort Website&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.amresorts.com\/wedding_guides\/nojrc-wedding-guide.pdf&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#008080;\"&gt;Wedding Guide&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/#!\/NowJade&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#008080;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Facebook Page&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.travelbybob.com\/517\/resort\/\/Now-Jade-Riviera-Cancun-Resort-&amp;amp;-Spa.html?t=1#map-tab&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#008080;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Resort Map&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;\n&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.nowresorts.com\/jade\/photos-videos#light_box_video_2&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#008080;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Virtual Tour&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;555 rooms, 7 different restaurants&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Symbolic or Non-Denominational Wedding&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;This ceremony focuses on love, marriage, family and society. Mexican law does not consider this ceremony legally valid. No documentation or blood tests are required.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Civil or Legal Ceremony&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;This ceremony is performed by a judge and focuses on family and respect for the couple. A list of requirements must be met in order to be legally married under Mexican law.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Legal Requirements:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Bride, Groom &amp;amp; Witnesses must arrive in Canc\u00ban 4 working days prior to the wedding day (Saturdays, Sundays &amp;amp; Holidays do not count). Symbolic and non-legal ceremonies allow flexibility for arrival date. Please speak with the wedding coordinator to discuss requirements.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;The wedding coordinator must receive the following documents in order to start the corresponding application for a Wedding in the Civil Registry Office.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Tourist Card (you will get one upon arrival to the Canc\u00ban airport). Make sure your name is written as it appears on your passport.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;If either the bride or groom is divorced, original Birth Certificates are required with the originating country\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Registry Stamp (Le Apostille). This document should be translated into Spanish. The cost is $50 USD + 11% tax per birth certificate. Translation must be done in Mexico to be considered valid.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;If bride is divorced, a copy of the Final Divorce Decree is required with your country\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Registry Stamp (Le Apostille). This document should be translated into Spanish. The cost is $50 USD + 11% tax per page. Translation must be done in Mexico to be considered valid.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Valid Passports.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Blood tests, performed in M\u00a9xico. Test are not valid if performed elsewhere and should not be performed more than 14 days prior to the ceremony. The blood will be tested for HIV, RPR (sexually transmitted diseases) and blood type. The results will be ready in 24 hours and will be provided with a certificate of the blood test. The charge is $250 USD + 11% tax per couple, to be paid directly to the doctor in cash the day the test is performed.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Witness Information. The names, addresses, nationalities, ages, occupation, relationship, copies of tourist cards and valid identification of the four witnesses. The Wedding Coordinator will provide the legal form to fill out.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Consider the fee for the Judge\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s transportation. The Judge usually performs the civil ceremony at their office, but will oblige to come to the resort if the transportation is provided. The round trip fare from the city is $70 USD. This should be paid directly to the Judge on the wedding day or can be arranged in advance through the wedding coordinator.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;The Marriage Certificate is only valid in Mexico. In order to make it legal internationally, the Wedding Coordinator will send a copy of your License to the Validation Process. The fee will be $165 USD +11% tax. The process will take up to 2-3 months. Once the document is apostilled, the resort will send all documentation to couples home address.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595152,"PostDate":1331759369,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"text-align:center\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Overall Coordinator is Pilar Gonzalez \/ Groups & Convention Manager<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Pilar - <a href='mailto:weddings.nojrc@nowresorts.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>weddings.nojrc@nowresorts.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">01152-998-872-8888 ext 4006<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.nowresorts.com\/jade' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:#008080\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Resort Website<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><a href='http:\/\/www.amresorts.com\/wedding_guides\/nojrc-wedding-guide.pdf' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:#008080\">Wedding Guide<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=26292\" title=\"\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_extra\/mime_types\/doc.gif\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n&nbsp;<a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=26292\" title=\"\"><strong>NOW WEDDING PLANNING  FORM.doc<\/strong><\/a> &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class='desc'><strong>141.5KB<\/strong><\/span>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"desc lighter\">6 <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/#!\/NowJade' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:#008080\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Facebook Page<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.travelbybob.com\/517\/resort\/\/Now-Jade-Riviera-Cancun-Resort-&-Spa.html?t=1#map-tab' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:#008080\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Resort Map<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/a><br><a href='http:\/\/www.nowresorts.com\/jade\/photos-videos#light_box_video_2' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:#008080\"><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Virtual Tour<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">555 rooms, 7 different restaurants<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Symbolic or Non-Denominational Wedding<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">This ceremony focuses on love, marriage, family and society. Mexican law does not consider this ceremony legally valid. No documentation or blood tests are required.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Civil or Legal Ceremony<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">This ceremony is performed by a judge and focuses on family and respect for the couple. A list of requirements must be met in order to be legally married under Mexican law.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Legal Requirements:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Bride, Groom & Witnesses must arrive in Canc\u00ban 4 working days prior to the wedding day (Saturdays, Sundays & Holidays do not count). Symbolic and non-legal ceremonies allow flexibility for arrival date. Please speak with the wedding coordinator to discuss requirements.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">The wedding coordinator must receive the following documents in order to start the corresponding application for a Wedding in the Civil Registry Office.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Tourist Card (you will get one upon arrival to the Canc\u00ban airport). Make sure your name is written as it appears on your passport.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">If either the bride or groom is divorced, original Birth Certificates are required with the originating country\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Registry Stamp (Le Apostille). This document should be translated into Spanish. The cost is $50 USD + 11% tax per birth certificate. Translation must be done in Mexico to be considered valid.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">If bride is divorced, a copy of the Final Divorce Decree is required with your country\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Registry Stamp (Le Apostille). This document should be translated into Spanish. The cost is $50 USD + 11% tax per page. Translation must be done in Mexico to be considered valid.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Valid Passports.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Blood tests, performed in M\u00a9xico. Test are not valid if performed elsewhere and should not be performed more than 14 days prior to the ceremony. The blood will be tested for HIV, RPR (sexually transmitted diseases) and blood type. The results will be ready in 24 hours and will be provided with a certificate of the blood test. The charge is $250 USD + 11% tax per couple, to be paid directly to the doctor in cash the day the test is performed.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Witness Information. The names, addresses, nationalities, ages, occupation, relationship, copies of tourist cards and valid identification of the four witnesses. The Wedding Coordinator will provide the legal form to fill out.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Consider the fee for the Judge\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s transportation. The Judge usually performs the civil ceremony at their office, but will oblige to come to the resort if the transportation is provided. The round trip fare from the city is $70 USD. This should be paid directly to the Judge on the wedding day or can be arranged in advance through the wedding coordinator.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">The Marriage Certificate is only valid in Mexico. In order to make it legal internationally, the Wedding Coordinator will send a copy of your License to the Validation Process. The fee will be $165 USD +11% tax. The process will take up to 2-3 months. Once the document is apostilled, the resort will send all documentation to couples home address.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1171995300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1392117004,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d95dba50a40d3daeeeb69d26f68e934","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wedding Packages&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Your Moments Wedding Package &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;2013\/2014 SELLING PRICE $999 USD OR COMPLIMENTARY &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#181818;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;(This package is complimentary when booking a minimum of 7 nights in the Preferred Club Ocean View or higher, or if 5 rooms are reserved for a minimum of 3 nights at any room category.)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\u2022 Dedicated wedding coordinator\n\n\u2022 Symbolic Ceremony*\n\n\u2022 Bouquet for the bride\n\n\u2022 Boutonniere for the groom\n\n\u2022 Preparation of the couple\u2019s wedding day attire\n\n\u2022 Wedding cake (for up to 10 guests)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\u2022 Sparkling wine toast (for up to 10 guests)\n\n\u2022 Romantic turndown service that evening: rose petal drawn Jacuzzi bath, bottle of sparkling wine and chocolate covered strawberries\n\n\u2022 Late check-out for the bride and groom (upon request)\n\n\u2022 20% off spa treatments&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Now to Eternity Wedding Package&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;2013 SELLING PRICE $2,399 USD \/\/ 2014 SELLING PRICE $2,499 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\u2022 Dedicated wedding coordinator\n\n\u2022 Service of a Judge or Minister\n\n\u2022 Bouquet for the bride\n\n\u2022 Boutonniere for the groom\n\n\u2022 Preparation of the couple\u2019s wedding day attire\n\n\u2022 Wedding cake (for up to 25 guests)\n\n\u2022 Sparkling wine toast (for up to 25 guests)\n\n\u2022 Complimentary room upgrade (based on availability)\n\n\u2022 Make-up and hair styling for the bride\n\n\u2022 Private Cocktail Hour with hors d\u2019oeuvres (for up to 25 guests)(silver menu)\n\n\u2022 Private dinner reception (for up to 25 guests)(silver menu)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\u2022 Swedish couples massage treatment (50 minutes)\n\n\u2022 Photo Package (24 full color photographs)\n\n\u2022 Breakfast in bed morning after ceremony with Mimosas\n\n\u2022 1 corsage and 1 boutonniere for the bridesmaid and best man\n\n\u2022 1 floral centerpiece arrangement for the reception table\n\n\u2022 Romantic turndown service that evening: rose petal drawn Jacuzzi bath, bottle of sparkling wine and chocolate covered strawberries\n\n\u2022 Late check-out for the bride and groom (upon request and availability)\n\n\u2022 20% off spa treatments (boutique purchases not included)\n\n\u2022 Free anniversary nights (see pg. 9 for details)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Diving Wedding Package&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;2013\/2014 SELLING PRICE $2,999 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\u2022 Dedicated wedding coordinator\n\n\u2022 Service of a Judge or Minister\n\n\u2022 Bouquet for the bride\n\n\u2022 Boutonniere for the groom\n\n\u2022 Preparation of the couple\u2019s wedding day attire\n\n\u2022 Wedding cake for up to 25 guests\n\n\u2022 Sparkling wine toast for up to 25 guests\n\n\u2022 Complimentary room upgrade (based on availability)\n\n\u2022 Makeup and hair styling for the bride on wedding day\n\n\u2022 Swedish couples massage treatment (50 minutes)\n\n\u2022 Breakfast in bed morning after ceremony with Mimosas\n\n\u2022 2 corsages and 2 boutonnieres for the wedding party\n\n\u2022 1 floral centerpiece arrangement for the reception table\n\n\u2022 Gazebo d\u00e9cor \u2014 25 chairs with white covers, ceremonial table and aisle runner\n\n\u2022 Private Cocktail Hour with hors d\u2019oeuvres for up to 25 guests (Platinum menu)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\u2022 Private Dinner Reception for up to 25 guests (Platinum menu)\n\n\u2022 Video of the ceremony (30-minute edited DVD)\n\n\u2022 Choice of guitarist or saxophonist at the ceremony (1 set, 45 minutes)\n\n\u2022 Photo package (24 color photographs taken during the ceremony) and wedding album\n\n\u2022 Romantic turndown service night of the ceremony with rose petal-drawn Jacuzzi bath, bottle of sparkling wine\n\nand chocolate-covered strawberries\n\n\u2022 Romantic dinner on the beach (one evening during stay)\n\n\u2022 Late checkout for the couple (upon request and availability)\n\n\u2022 20% off spa treatments (boutique purchases not included)\n\n\u2022 Free Anniversary Nights (see pg. 9 for details)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;If you have over 25 guests the following charges will apply:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Eternity Dinner: $48 per person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Diving Dinner: $53 per person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Cake: $7 per person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Champagne: $4 per person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Cocktail hour: $15 per person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Up can upgrade to the Devine dinner menu for $5 per guest.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif;\"&gt;The wedding packages include white chair covers, white table linens, and white decorations at the ceremony site.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595153,"PostDate":1331759374,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Wedding Packages<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">Your Moments Wedding Package <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">2013\/2014 SELLING PRICE $999 USD OR COMPLIMENTARY <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"color:#181818\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">(This package is complimentary when booking a minimum of 7 nights in the Preferred Club Ocean View or higher, or if 5 rooms are reserved for a minimum of 3 nights at any room category.)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u2022 Dedicated wedding coordinator<br>\n\u2022 Symbolic Ceremony*<br>\n\u2022 Bouquet for the bride<br>\n\u2022 Boutonniere for the groom<br>\n\u2022 Preparation of the couple\u2019s wedding day attire<br>\n\u2022 Wedding cake (for up to 10 guests)<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 Sparkling wine toast (for up to 10 guests)<br>\n\u2022 Romantic turndown service that evening: rose petal drawn Jacuzzi bath, bottle of sparkling wine and chocolate covered strawberries<br>\n\u2022 Late check-out for the bride and groom (upon request)<br>\n\u2022 20% off spa treatments<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><strong><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Now to Eternity Wedding Package<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><strong><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">2013 SELLING PRICE $2,399 USD \/\/ 2014 SELLING PRICE $2,499 USD<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u2022 Dedicated wedding coordinator<br>\n\u2022 Service of a Judge or Minister<br>\n\u2022 Bouquet for the bride<br>\n\u2022 Boutonniere for the groom<br>\n\u2022 Preparation of the couple\u2019s wedding day attire<br>\n\u2022 Wedding cake (for up to 25 guests)<br>\n\u2022 Sparkling wine toast (for up to 25 guests)<br>\n\u2022 Complimentary room upgrade (based on availability)<br>\n\u2022 Make-up and hair styling for the bride<br>\n\u2022 Private Cocktail Hour with hors d\u2019oeuvres (for up to 25 guests)(silver menu)<br>\n\u2022 Private dinner reception (for up to 25 guests)(silver menu)<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 Swedish couples massage treatment (50 minutes)<br>\n\u2022 Photo Package (24 full color photographs)<br>\n\u2022 Breakfast in bed morning after ceremony with Mimosas<br>\n\u2022 1 corsage and 1 boutonniere for the bridesmaid and best man<br>\n\u2022 1 floral centerpiece arrangement for the reception table<br>\n\u2022 Romantic turndown service that evening: rose petal drawn Jacuzzi bath, bottle of sparkling wine and chocolate covered strawberries<br>\n\u2022 Late check-out for the bride and groom (upon request and availability)<br>\n\u2022 20% off spa treatments (boutique purchases not included)<br>\n\u2022 Free anniversary nights (see pg. 9 for details)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Diving Wedding Package<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">2013\/2014 SELLING PRICE $2,999 USD<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 Dedicated wedding coordinator<br>\n\u2022 Service of a Judge or Minister<br>\n\u2022 Bouquet for the bride<br>\n\u2022 Boutonniere for the groom<br>\n\u2022 Preparation of the couple\u2019s wedding day attire<br>\n\u2022 Wedding cake for up to 25 guests<br>\n\u2022 Sparkling wine toast for up to 25 guests<br>\n\u2022 Complimentary room upgrade (based on availability)<br>\n\u2022 Makeup and hair styling for the bride on wedding day<br>\n\u2022 Swedish couples massage treatment (50 minutes)<br>\n\u2022 Breakfast in bed morning after ceremony with Mimosas<br>\n\u2022 2 corsages and 2 boutonnieres for the wedding party<br>\n\u2022 1 floral centerpiece arrangement for the reception table<br>\n\u2022 Gazebo d\u00e9cor \u2014 25 chairs with white covers, ceremonial table and aisle runner<br>\n\u2022 Private Cocktail Hour with hors d\u2019oeuvres for up to 25 guests (Platinum menu)<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 Private Dinner Reception for up to 25 guests (Platinum menu)<br>\n\u2022 Video of the ceremony (30-minute edited DVD)<br>\n\u2022 Choice of guitarist or saxophonist at the ceremony (1 set, 45 minutes)<br>\n\u2022 Photo package (24 color photographs taken during the ceremony) and wedding album<br>\n\u2022 Romantic turndown service night of the ceremony with rose petal-drawn Jacuzzi bath, bottle of sparkling wine<br>\nand chocolate-covered strawberries<br>\n\u2022 Romantic dinner on the beach (one evening during stay)<br>\n\u2022 Late checkout for the couple (upon request and availability)<br>\n\u2022 20% off spa treatments (boutique purchases not included)<br>\n\u2022 Free Anniversary Nights (see pg. 9 for details)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">If you have over 25 guests the following charges will apply:<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Eternity Dinner: $48 per person<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Diving Dinner: $53 per person<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Cake: $7 per person<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Champagne: $4 per person<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Cocktail hour: $15 per person<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Up can upgrade to the Devine dinner menu for $5 per guest.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif\">The wedding packages include white chair covers, white table linens, and white decorations at the ceremony site.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1171995300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1392117377,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4313b3b9a6f87aec2c40a8a6a8e06e13","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Additional Wedding Services (whether ala carte or adding to your package)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CEREMONY&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Nondenominational Minister $450&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Services of the Judge (Legal) $600 (includes paperwork, judge\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s fees, and marriage license)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Blood test and medical certification (must be paid in cash directly to the doctor) $250&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Certified translation (per sheet) $50&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Tiffany Chairs $10 per chair&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SET UP&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Basic ceremony setup (2-50 guests) $200 (chairs with white covers and table for judge)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Basic ceremony setup (50-100 guests) $300 (chairs with white covers and table for judge)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Basic ceremony setup (101-200 guests) $400 (chairs with white covers and table for judge)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Deluxe s ceremony setup (per person) $15(chairs with white covers, bow and flower corsage hanging in back)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Dance floor for reception (2-50 guests) $800&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Dance floor for reception (50-100 guests) $1,200&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FOOD AND BEVERAGE &lt;\/strong&gt;(prices plus 11% tax and 15% service charge)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Champagne toast (sparkling wine) $4 per person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Wedding cake $5-8 per person (depending on the design selected)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Hors d\u00e2\u20ac\u2122oeuvres $15 per person per hour (8 pieces per person)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Cocktails $15 per person per hour&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Eternity Dinner $48 per person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Divine Dinner $53 per person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Private event at restaurant terrace $500 (this fee is for the location and does NOT include food and service charge.&amp;nbsp; Accommodates 30-50 guests)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MUSIC (PRICES PLUS 16% TAX)&lt;\/strong&gt;\n\nSound System equipment per event\n\n1-50 guests $150\n\n50-150 guests $300\n\nViolinist 45 minute set $650\n\nGuitarist 45 minute set $650\n\nSaxophonist 45 minute set $650\n\nJazz Trio 45 minute set $1,100\n\nPiano 45 minute set $770\n\nTrio 45 minute set $2,800\n\nHarp 45 minute set $900\n\nClassical Trio 45 minute set $1,200\n\nMariachi (6 men playing) 45 minute set $1,100\n\nMariachi (10 men playing) 45 minute set $1,500\n\nDJ services (4 hrs.) $1,000\n\nAdditional DJ hr $350\n\nBand 45 minute set $1,400\n\nSteel Drum 45 minute set $950&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PHOTOGRAPHY AND VIDEOGRAPHY&lt;\/strong&gt;\n\nOnline Slideshow free with every wedding\n\nIndividual photos (8x6 prints or image cd\/license) $15 ea&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standard Packages&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Standard Photo Package 1 $699\n\n1 Hour Coverage (Ceremony + Photo Session) + 40 images on CD&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Standard Photo Package 2 $950\n\n3 Hours Coverage (getting ready, ceremony, photo session, cocktail party) + 60 images on cd&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Standard Photo Package 3 $1,150\n\nFull 1 Day Coverage (getting ready, ceremony, photo session, cocktail party, reception, cake cutting) + 100 images on CD&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Standard Photo Package 4 $1,599\n\nComplete Wedding Coverage (rehearsal dinner, spa, getting ready, ceremony, photo session, cocktail party, reception, cake cutting, trash the dress) +200 images&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Additional Photographer (per hour) $99&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Luxury Wedding Book\n\n30 layouts 30 pages up to 60 images $699\n\n40 layouts 40 pages up to 80 images $999\n\n60 layouts 60 pages up to 100 images $1,199&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Fine art canvas prints\n\n16x24 fine art canvas print $129\n\n20x30 fine art canvas print $169\n\n24x36 fine art canvas print $199&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complete Wedding Collection&lt;\/strong&gt;\n\n300 images + Luxury Wedding Book with 15 Layouts (40 pages) $1,999&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;300 high resolution images on disk, online slideshow, online gallery, vision art book with 15 layouts (30 pages) &amp;amp; 16x24 fine art canvas print $2,195&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;All your high resolution wedding images on disk, online slideshow, online gallery vision art book with 20 layouts (40 pages) &amp;amp; 16x24 fine art canvas print $2,950&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Video Package #1 $590\n\n\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital &amp;amp; special effects, addition, music &amp;amp; titles.\n\n\u2022 Full digital edition. Professional digital camera.\n\n\u2022 90 to 120 min. of service. 30 to 40 minutes edited video. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;\u2022 &lt;\/span&gt;Master DVD with interactive menus.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Video Package #2 $1,000\n\n\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital &amp;amp; special effects, addition, music &amp;amp; titles.\n\n\u2022 Full digital edition. 1 professional digital camera.\n\n\u2022 3 to 4 hours of service. 60 minutes edited video. Master\n&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;\u2022 &lt;\/span&gt;DVD with interactive menus.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Video Package #3 $1,620&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital &amp;amp; special effects, addition, music &amp;amp; titles\n\n\u2022 Full digital edition. 1 professional digital camera.\n\n\u2022 8 hours of service. 90 to 120 minutes edited video.\n\n\u2022 Master DVD with interactive menus.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Video Package #4 $2,100\n\n\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital &amp;amp; special effects, addition, music &amp;amp; titles.\n\n\u2022 Full digital edition. 1 professional digital camera.\n\n\u2022 6 hours of service. 90 to 120 minutes edited video.\n\n\u2022 Master DVD with interactive menus.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Additional copy of DVD $80\n\nAdditional Hour of Photo Services $280\n\nAdditional Hour of Video Service $280&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PHOTOBOOTH&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Silver $649&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Includes 3 hours of service, photo booth attendee, 100 4x6 prints, party props, DVD of all photos and videos professionally edited, set-up and break-down.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Gold $799&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Includes 4 hours of service, photo booth attendee, 215 4x6 prints, party props, DVD of all photos and videos professionally edited, set-up and break-down&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;* Additional Hour $165.00 USD. Venue will have to be confirmed at least 3 days prior the event, due to space and weather conditions. Prices don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t include tax and are subject to change&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLOWERS &lt;\/strong&gt;(prices plus 11% tax)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Tropical Bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bouquet Selection $80&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Luxury Bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bouquet $125&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Premium Bouquet Selection $350&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Bridesmaid\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bouquet $65&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Corsages (wrist or shoulder) $35&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Premium Corsages $55&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Boutonniere $20&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Premium Boutonniere $45&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Tropical Dinner Centerpieces $65&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Luxury Dinner Centerpieces $85&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Premium Dinner Centerpieces $230&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Ceremony Centerpiece $50&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Columns and Arrangements (2) $180&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Canopy $350&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Flower Wedding Arch $450&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Single Flower $12&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Bag with Petals $15&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Basket with Petals $35&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECORATIONS (Prices plus 16% tax)&lt;\/strong&gt;\n\nDance Floor for Reception (2-50 pax) $800.00\n\nDance Floor for Reception (50-100 pax) $1200.00\n\nPaper Luminaries $5.00\n\nTikki torches decoration (6 pieces per event) $150.00\n\nTiffany Chairs $10.00 (Available in white, gold, silver, brown)\n\nBamboo Chairs $10.00\n\nVersalles Chairs Available only in dark brown $10.00\n\nAvant-garde chairs available only in white $15.00\n\nRegular Ribbons for chairs $5.00 (Red, brown, yellow, green, pink, ivory, white, purple, contact your wedding coordinator for special request)\n\nLinen (per table) from $18.00 to $25\n\nTable Overlay (per table) from $18.00 to $25&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Special Color napkin (per pax) $4.00\n\nFans (Castaways restaurant) $150 ( mandatory on April, May, June months)\n\nLight Packages $350&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HOTEL PASSES &lt;\/strong&gt;(guests arriving from other properties)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Day Pass (9:00am-6:00pm) $65 per person\n\nNight Pass (6:00pm-1:00am) $75 per person\n\nFull Pass (9:00am-2:00am) $55 per person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;*&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt; Prices are subject to change without prior notice&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595154,"PostDate":1331759377,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Additional Wedding Services (whether ala carte or adding to your package)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>CEREMONY<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Nondenominational Minister $450<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Services of the Judge (Legal) $600 (includes paperwork, judge\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s fees, and marriage license)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Blood test and medical certification (must be paid in cash directly to the doctor) $250<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Certified translation (per sheet) $50<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Tiffany Chairs $10 per chair<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>SET UP<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Basic ceremony setup (2-50 guests) $200 (chairs with white covers and table for judge)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Basic ceremony setup (50-100 guests) $300 (chairs with white covers and table for judge)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Basic ceremony setup (101-200 guests) $400 (chairs with white covers and table for judge)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Deluxe s ceremony setup (per person) $15(chairs with white covers, bow and flower corsage hanging in back)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Dance floor for reception (2-50 guests) $800<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Dance floor for reception (50-100 guests) $1,200<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>FOOD AND BEVERAGE <\/strong>(prices plus 11% tax and 15% service charge)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Champagne toast (sparkling wine) $4 per person<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Wedding cake $5-8 per person (depending on the design selected)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Hors d\u00e2\u20ac\u2122oeuvres $15 per person per hour (8 pieces per person)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Cocktails $15 per person per hour<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Eternity Dinner $48 per person<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Divine Dinner $53 per person<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Private event at restaurant terrace $500 (this fee is for the location and does NOT include food and service charge.\u00a0 Accommodates 30-50 guests)<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>MUSIC (PRICES PLUS 16% TAX)<\/strong><br>\nSound System equipment per event<br>\n1-50 guests $150<br>\n50-150 guests $300<br>\nViolinist 45 minute set $650<br>\nGuitarist 45 minute set $650<br>\nSaxophonist 45 minute set $650<br>\nJazz Trio 45 minute set $1,100<br>\nPiano 45 minute set $770<br>\nTrio 45 minute set $2,800<br>\nHarp 45 minute set $900<br>\nClassical Trio 45 minute set $1,200<br>\nMariachi (6 men playing) 45 minute set $1,100<br>\nMariachi (10 men playing) 45 minute set $1,500<br>\nDJ services (4 hrs.) $1,000<br>\nAdditional DJ hr $350<br>\nBand 45 minute set $1,400<br>\nSteel Drum 45 minute set $950<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>PHOTOGRAPHY AND VIDEOGRAPHY<\/strong><br>\nOnline Slideshow free with every wedding<br>\nIndividual photos (8x6 prints or image cd\/license) $15 ea<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>Standard Packages<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Standard Photo Package 1 $699<br>\n1 Hour Coverage (Ceremony + Photo Session) + 40 images on CD<\/span><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Standard Photo Package 2 $950<br>\n3 Hours Coverage (getting ready, ceremony, photo session, cocktail party) + 60 images on cd<\/span><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Standard Photo Package 3 $1,150<br>\nFull 1 Day Coverage (getting ready, ceremony, photo session, cocktail party, reception, cake cutting) + 100 images on CD<\/span><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Standard Photo Package 4 $1,599<br>\nComplete Wedding Coverage (rehearsal dinner, spa, getting ready, ceremony, photo session, cocktail party, reception, cake cutting, trash the dress) +200 images<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Additional Photographer (per hour) $99<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Luxury Wedding Book<br>\n30 layouts 30 pages up to 60 images $699<br>\n40 layouts 40 pages up to 80 images $999<br>\n60 layouts 60 pages up to 100 images $1,199<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Fine art canvas prints<br>\n16x24 fine art canvas print $129<br>\n20x30 fine art canvas print $169<br>\n24x36 fine art canvas print $199<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>Complete Wedding Collection<\/strong><br>\n300 images + Luxury Wedding Book with 15 Layouts (40 pages) $1,999<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">300 high resolution images on disk, online slideshow, online gallery, vision art book with 15 layouts (30 pages) & 16x24 fine art canvas print $2,195<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">All your high resolution wedding images on disk, online slideshow, online gallery vision art book with 20 layouts (40 pages) & 16x24 fine art canvas print $2,950<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Video Package #1 $590<br>\n\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital & special effects, addition, music & titles.<br>\n\u2022 Full digital edition. Professional digital camera.<br>\n\u2022 90 to 120 min. of service. 30 to 40 minutes edited video. <\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">\u2022 <\/span>Master DVD with interactive menus.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Video Package #2 $1,000<br>\n\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital & special effects, addition, music & titles.<br>\n\u2022 Full digital edition. 1 professional digital camera.<br>\n\u2022 3 to 4 hours of service. 60 minutes edited video. Master<br><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">\u2022 <\/span>DVD with interactive menus.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Video Package #3 $1,620<\/span><br><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital & special effects, addition, music & titles<br>\n\u2022 Full digital edition. 1 professional digital camera.<br>\n\u2022 8 hours of service. 90 to 120 minutes edited video.<br>\n\u2022 Master DVD with interactive menus.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Video Package #4 $2,100<br>\n\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital & special effects, addition, music & titles.<br>\n\u2022 Full digital edition. 1 professional digital camera.<br>\n\u2022 6 hours of service. 90 to 120 minutes edited video.<br>\n\u2022 Master DVD with interactive menus.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Additional copy of DVD $80<br>\nAdditional Hour of Photo Services $280<br>\nAdditional Hour of Video Service $280<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>PHOTOBOOTH<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Silver $649<\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Includes 3 hours of service, photo booth attendee, 100 4x6 prints, party props, DVD of all photos and videos professionally edited, set-up and break-down.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Gold $799<\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Includes 4 hours of service, photo booth attendee, 215 4x6 prints, party props, DVD of all photos and videos professionally edited, set-up and break-down<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><em><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">* Additional Hour $165.00 USD. Venue will have to be confirmed at least 3 days prior the event, due to space and weather conditions. Prices don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t include tax and are subject to change<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>FLOWERS <\/strong>(prices plus 11% tax)<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Tropical Bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bouquet Selection $80<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Luxury Bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bouquet $125<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Premium Bouquet Selection $350<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Bridesmaid\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bouquet $65<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Corsages (wrist or shoulder) $35<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Premium Corsages $55<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Boutonniere $20<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Premium Boutonniere $45<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Tropical Dinner Centerpieces $65<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Luxury Dinner Centerpieces $85<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Premium Dinner Centerpieces $230<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Ceremony Centerpiece $50<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns and Arrangements (2) $180<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Canopy $350<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Flower Wedding Arch $450<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Single Flower $12<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Bag with Petals $15<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Basket with Petals $35<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>DECORATIONS (Prices plus 16% tax)<\/strong><br>\nDance Floor for Reception (2-50 pax) $800.00<br>\nDance Floor for Reception (50-100 pax) $1200.00<br>\nPaper Luminaries $5.00<br>\nTikki torches decoration (6 pieces per event) $150.00<br>\nTiffany Chairs $10.00 (Available in white, gold, silver, brown)<br>\nBamboo Chairs $10.00<br>\nVersalles Chairs Available only in dark brown $10.00<br>\nAvant-garde chairs available only in white $15.00<br>\nRegular Ribbons for chairs $5.00 (Red, brown, yellow, green, pink, ivory, white, purple, contact your wedding coordinator for special request)<br>\nLinen (per table) from $18.00 to $25<br>\nTable Overlay (per table) from $18.00 to $25<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Special Color napkin (per pax) $4.00<br>\nFans (Castaways restaurant) $150 ( mandatory on April, May, June months)<br>\nLight Packages $350<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>HOTEL PASSES <\/strong>(guests arriving from other properties)<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Day Pass (9:00am-6:00pm) $65 per person<br>\nNight Pass (6:00pm-1:00am) $75 per person<br>\nFull Pass (9:00am-2:00am) $55 per person<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">*<em><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"> Prices are subject to change without prior notice<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1171995300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"377a6bd4acf8e4d5a0d49f65949e4e84","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Wedding Locations&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;The Pergola&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;The Beach&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;The Fountain&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;The Garden&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Now Jade Ceremony Locations.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762850\/width\/600\/height\/524\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pergola Ceremony Photos:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Pergola v1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762852\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Pergola v2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762854\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Pergola v3.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762856\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Pergola v4.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762858\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Pergola v5.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762860\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Pergola v6.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762862\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Pergola v7.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762864\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Pergola v8.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762866\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Pergola v9.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762868\/width\/600\/height\/399\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Beach Ceremony Location v10.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762884\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beach Ceremony Photos&lt;\/strong&gt;:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Beach Ceremony Location v2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762870\/width\/600\/height\/401\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Beach Ceremony Location v3.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762872\/width\/600\/height\/337\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Beach Ceremony Location v4.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762874\/width\/600\/height\/399\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Beach Ceremony Location v5.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762876\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Beach Ceremony Location v6.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762878\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Beach Ceremony Location v7.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762880\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Beach Ceremony Location v9.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762882\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Beach Ceremony Location v11.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762886\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Beach Ceremony Location.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762888\/width\/321\/height\/480\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fountain Wedding Ceremony Photos:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Fountain Wedding Location v1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762890\/width\/600\/height\/398\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Fountain Wedding Location v2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762892\/width\/600\/height\/398\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Fountain Wedding Location v3.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762894\/width\/600\/height\/355\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Garden Wedding Ceremony Photos:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Garden Wedding Ceremony v1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762896\/width\/600\/height\/448\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595155,"PostDate":1331759380,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Wedding Locations<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">The Pergola<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">The Beach<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">The Fountain<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">The Garden<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Now Jade Ceremony Locations.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762850\/width\/600\/height\/524\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><strong>Pergola Ceremony Photos:<\/strong><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Pergola v1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762852\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Pergola v2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762854\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Pergola v3.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762856\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Pergola v4.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762858\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Pergola v5.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762860\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Pergola v6.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762862\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Pergola v7.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762864\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Pergola v8.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762866\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Pergola v9.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762868\/width\/600\/height\/399\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Beach Ceremony Location v10.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762884\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><strong>Beach Ceremony Photos<\/strong>:<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Beach Ceremony Location v2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762870\/width\/600\/height\/401\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Beach Ceremony Location v3.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762872\/width\/600\/height\/337\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Beach Ceremony Location v4.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762874\/width\/600\/height\/399\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Beach Ceremony Location v5.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762876\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Beach Ceremony Location v6.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762878\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Beach Ceremony Location v7.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762880\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Beach Ceremony Location v9.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762882\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Beach Ceremony Location v11.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762886\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Beach Ceremony Location.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762888\/width\/321\/height\/480\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><strong>Fountain Wedding Ceremony Photos:<\/strong><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Fountain Wedding Location v1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762890\/width\/600\/height\/398\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Fountain Wedding Location v2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762892\/width\/600\/height\/398\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Fountain Wedding Location v3.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762894\/width\/600\/height\/355\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><strong>Garden Wedding Ceremony Photos:<\/strong><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Garden Wedding Ceremony v1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762896\/width\/600\/height\/448\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1171995300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f2a1ad67c16393f17adda849a71a03f0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;PDF (note, most pictures are also down below, so if you don&#039;t have 150 posts yet and cannot open this document, don&#039;t worry too much)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;13446&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;NOW JADE DINNER LOCATIONS.pdf&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;NOW Jade Dinner Location options&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;4,671&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;pdf&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Room Capacities:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362147324443_567\"&gt;  &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Pool Terrace ( maximum 40 guest)&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;div id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362147324443_566\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Ocean Front Deck (Carnival Terrace) ( maximum 60 guest)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362147324443_565\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362147324443_564\" style=\"line-height: 1.231\"&gt;Beach ( maximum 80 guest)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362147324443_563\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Garden ( maximum 120 guest)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362147324443_558\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Bamboo Room ( Private Ocean View Room \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Maximum 80 guest)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362147324443_557\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Castaways Restaurant ( from 07:00pm-10:00pm Maximum 120 guest)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;  &amp;nbsp;  &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Here is a little map to show the locations of some of the wedding locations:&lt;\/span&gt;  &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362407084567_1829\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"LEAD Technologies Inc. V1.01&#10;\" data-id=\"191816\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"312\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/191816\/width\/350\/height\/700\" width=\"410\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;   &amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Cocktail Hour Locations:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;The Mix Beach Bar\/Blue Bar&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;The Orange Room&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"NOW Jade Cocktail Party Options.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762734\/width\/600\/height\/481\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Here is another shot of the Blue Beach Bar&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Blue Beach Bar v2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762738\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Reception Locations:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Las Olas\/Castaways&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Yellow Room\/Bamboo Room&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Festival Terrace\/Carnival Terrace&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Blue Beach Bar\/Mix Beach Bar&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Pool Deck&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Beach&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Castaways Pictures:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Castaways Reception v1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762740\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Castaways Reception v2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762742\/width\/397\/height\/600\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Castaways Reception v3.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762744\/width\/600\/height\/398\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Castaways Reception v4.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762746\/width\/600\/height\/398\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Castaways Reception v5.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762748\/width\/600\/height\/398\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Castaways Reception v6.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762750\/width\/600\/height\/398\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Bamboo Room Reception Photos:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Bamboo Room Reception v2.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762754\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Bamboo Room Reception Table v2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762756\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Bamboo Room Reception Table.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762760\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Bamboo Room Reception v3.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762762\/width\/600\/height\/316\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Bamboo Room Reception v4.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762764\/width\/600\/height\/402\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Bamboo Room Reception v5.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762768\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Bamboo Room Dessert Table.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762770\/width\/600\/height\/376\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Yellow Room v2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762774\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Yellow Room.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762776\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Festival\/Carnival Terrace Reception Photos&lt;\/strong&gt;:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Festival Terrace.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762778\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Festival Terrace from beach.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762780\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Festival Terrace Reception v1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762782\/width\/600\/height\/398\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Outdoor Reception Photos:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Outdoor Lawn Reception.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762784\/width\/310\/height\/463\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Outdoor Reception v2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762788\/width\/600\/height\/399\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Outdoor Reception.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762790\/width\/600\/height\/399\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;All receptions are three hours long.&amp;nbsp; The extra hour cost depends on number of guests, however for 75 people it is approximately $1200.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;If you\u00e2\u20ac\u2122d like a private bar AT your reception location it is a $350 one time setup fee. (FYI, most brides have said this is not worth it.&amp;nbsp; You&#039;ll have more than enough servers at your event to keep your guests happy)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;If you have over 50 people, you can have a buffet.&amp;nbsp; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/57821\/the-now-riviera-cancun\/370#post_1413517\"&gt;THIS&lt;\/a&gt; post lists the buffet options. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;The reception areas are either round tables that seat 6-10 or rectangle tables that seat up to 40 people.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;There are divine and eternity dinner options (4 entree choices in total) and your guests can choose their entree in advance for free, or on the spot for an extra $30 per person, or you can choose for them for free.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Children\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s menus are available for $20-25&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;The kid menu: fruit cocktail, cheese burger, chicken fingers, spaghetti, and ice cream.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;The Vegetarian option is the same price as the other meals.&amp;nbsp; Here is the menu:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Vegetarian Menu&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Salads:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Arugula salad companied with pear layers, lime vinaigrette and extra virgin olive oil&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Toscana salad, mixed lettuce, tomato, mushrooms, asparagus, endives, Californian peaches and artichokes with sun dry tomato vinaigrette&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Soup:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Minestrone soup and spinach&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Main Course:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Pasta Penne in a tomato and basil sauce with vegetables&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Vegetable lasagna&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Desserts:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Cottage cheese foam and strawberries&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595156,"PostDate":1331759383,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">PDF (note, most pictures are also down below, so if you don't have 150 posts yet and cannot open this document, don't worry too much)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">\u00a0<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"13446\",\"name\":\"NOW JADE DINNER LOCATIONS.pdf\",\"description\":\"NOW Jade Dinner Location options\",\"size\":\"4,671\",\"type\":\"pdf\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">\u00a0<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Room Capacities:<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <div id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362147324443_567\">  <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Pool Terrace ( maximum 40 guest)<\/span> <div id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362147324443_566\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Ocean Front Deck (Carnival Terrace) ( maximum 60 guest)<\/span><\/div> <\/div> <div id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362147324443_565\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><spanid=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362147324443_564\" >Beach ( maximum 80 guest)<\/span><\/span><\/div> <div id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362147324443_563\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Garden ( maximum 120 guest)<\/span><\/div> <div id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362147324443_558\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Bamboo Room ( Private Ocean View Room \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Maximum 80 guest)<\/span><\/div> <div id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362147324443_557\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Castaways Restaurant ( from 07:00pm-10:00pm Maximum 120 guest)<\/span><\/div>  \u00a0  <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Here is a little map to show the locations of some of the wedding locations:<\/span>  <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362407084567_1829\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"LEAD Technologies Inc. V1.01&#10;\" data-id=\"191816\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"312\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/191816\/width\/350\/height\/700\" width=\"410\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>   \u00a0 <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Cocktail Hour Locations:<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">The Mix Beach Bar\/Blue Bar<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">The Orange Room<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"NOW Jade Cocktail Party Options.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762734\/width\/600\/height\/481\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Here is another shot of the Blue Beach Bar<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Blue Beach Bar v2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762738\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Reception Locations:<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Las Olas\/Castaways<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Yellow Room\/Bamboo Room<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Festival Terrace\/Carnival Terrace<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Blue Beach Bar\/Mix Beach Bar<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Pool Deck<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Beach<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong>Castaways Pictures:<\/strong><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Castaways Reception v1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762740\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Castaways Reception v2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762742\/width\/397\/height\/600\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Castaways Reception v3.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762744\/width\/600\/height\/398\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Castaways Reception v4.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762746\/width\/600\/height\/398\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Castaways Reception v5.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762748\/width\/600\/height\/398\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Castaways Reception v6.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762750\/width\/600\/height\/398\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong>Bamboo Room Reception Photos:<\/strong><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Bamboo Room Reception v2.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762754\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Bamboo Room Reception Table v2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762756\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Bamboo Room Reception Table.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762760\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Bamboo Room Reception v3.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762762\/width\/600\/height\/316\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Bamboo Room Reception v4.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762764\/width\/600\/height\/402\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Bamboo Room Reception v5.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762768\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Bamboo Room Dessert Table.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762770\/width\/600\/height\/376\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Yellow Room v2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762774\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Yellow Room.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762776\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong>Festival\/Carnival Terrace Reception Photos<\/strong>:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Festival Terrace.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762778\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Festival Terrace from beach.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762780\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Festival Terrace Reception v1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762782\/width\/600\/height\/398\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong>Outdoor Reception Photos:<\/strong><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Outdoor Lawn Reception.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762784\/width\/310\/height\/463\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Outdoor Reception v2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762788\/width\/600\/height\/399\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Outdoor Reception.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762790\/width\/600\/height\/399\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">All receptions are three hours long.\u00a0 The extra hour cost depends on number of guests, however for 75 people it is approximately $1200.<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">If you\u00e2\u20ac\u2122d like a private bar AT your reception location it is a $350 one time setup fee. (FYI, most brides have said this is not worth it.\u00a0 You'll have more than enough servers at your event to keep your guests happy)<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">If you have over 50 people, you can have a buffet.\u00a0 <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/57821\/the-now-riviera-cancun\/370#post_1413517' class='bbc_url' title=''>THIS<\/a> post lists the buffet options. <\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">The reception areas are either round tables that seat 6-10 or rectangle tables that seat up to 40 people.<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">There are divine and eternity dinner options (4 entree choices in total) and your guests can choose their entree in advance for free, or on the spot for an extra $30 per person, or you can choose for them for free.<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Children\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s menus are available for $20-25<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">The kid menu: fruit cocktail, cheese burger, chicken fingers, spaghetti, and ice cream.<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">The Vegetarian option is the same price as the other meals.\u00a0 Here is the menu:<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Vegetarian Menu<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Salads:<\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Arugula salad companied with pear layers, lime vinaigrette and extra virgin olive oil<\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Toscana salad, mixed lettuce, tomato, mushrooms, asparagus, endives, Californian peaches and artichokes with sun dry tomato vinaigrette<\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Soup:<\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Minestrone soup and spinach<\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Main Course:<\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Pasta Penne in a tomato and basil sauce with vegetables<\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Vegetable lasagna<\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Desserts:<\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Cottage cheese foam and strawberries<\/span><\/li> <\/ul>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1171995300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3581572cbb38dab4a9d6f8045ca23799","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;DJ&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;The resort uses a few different DJ\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s.&amp;nbsp; AV Solutions, DJ Dorremix, and Luis De Alba&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Alex Martinez&lt;\/span&gt; - AV Solutions&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: blue\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Mariachi Band.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762937\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595157,"PostDate":1331759386,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">DJ<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">The resort uses a few different DJ\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s.\u00a0 AV Solutions, DJ Dorremix, and Luis De Alba<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Alex Martinez<\/span> - AV Solutions<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span  style=\"color: blue\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Mariachi Band.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762937\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1171995300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4946a30cbeeeb387039480c6c54ac7ba","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Cake&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Eternity Cakes (included in the Eternity Package)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Serves up to 25 people&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;$7 per additional person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Flavors:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;White Cream Cake: A silky smooth cake made with rich cream for a moist, tender finish. Great with our classic butter cream or a fruit filling.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Golden Yellow Cake: Delicate, tender cake with a hint of pure vanilla. Excellent with a fruit filling or loaded with a dark fudge filling.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Chocolate Fudge Cake: Rich, deep dark chocolate cake made with pure dark chocolate. Generously covered with butter cream and filled with chocolate fudge.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Chocolate Kahlua Symphony: An unforgettable combination of rich chocolate layers and coffee liqueur. Excellent with a mocha filling.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Eternity Cake Options.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762922\/width\/600\/height\/508\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Divine Cakes (included in the Devine Package)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Serves up to 20 people&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;$8 per additional person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Flavors:&amp;nbsp; You select the cake flavor and then select the filing to go inside it&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Marble Fudge Cake: A moist marriage of white cake with dark chocolate to create rivers of fudge, all wrapped up in our elegant butter cream.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Almond Delight Cake: White moist layers with a delicate, fresh roasted, ground almond filling. A truly elegant cake for an elegant occasion.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Lemon Twist Mellow: A hint of lemon and a divine creamy lemon filling. Wonderful with a raspberry filling.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Bella Matrimoniale Classic: Three moist layers of white cake with two fillings, almond and raspberry. Your Guests will say \u00e2\u20ac\u0153Wow\u00e2\u20ac\u009d and ask for seconds.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Cheese Cake Showstopper: Creamy New York cheesecake baked to perfection and frosted with our special butter cream or whipped cream.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Chocolate Passion Black Tie: Cake made with the finest imported dark chocolate filled with variety of berries.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Fillings: Vanilla, Chocolate, Raspberry, Strawberry, Fresh Sliced Strawberries, Peaches, Pineapples Roasted Almond&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Divine Cake Options.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762924\/width\/600\/height\/514\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Here are some BDW Bride&#039;s Cake Photos:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Wedding Cake v2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762926\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Wedding Cake v3.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762928\/width\/340\/height\/510\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Wedding Cake.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762930\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595158,"PostDate":1331759390,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Cake<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><strong>Eternity Cakes (included in the Eternity Package)<\/strong><\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Serves up to 25 people<\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">$7 per additional person<\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Flavors:<\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">White Cream Cake: A silky smooth cake made with rich cream for a moist, tender finish. Great with our classic butter cream or a fruit filling.<\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Golden Yellow Cake: Delicate, tender cake with a hint of pure vanilla. Excellent with a fruit filling or loaded with a dark fudge filling.<\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Chocolate Fudge Cake: Rich, deep dark chocolate cake made with pure dark chocolate. Generously covered with butter cream and filled with chocolate fudge.<\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Chocolate Kahlua Symphony: An unforgettable combination of rich chocolate layers and coffee liqueur. Excellent with a mocha filling.<\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Eternity Cake Options.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762922\/width\/600\/height\/508\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><strong>Divine Cakes (included in the Devine Package)<\/strong><\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Serves up to 20 people<\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">$8 per additional person<\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Flavors:\u00a0 You select the cake flavor and then select the filing to go inside it<\/span><\/p> <ul> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Marble Fudge Cake: A moist marriage of white cake with dark chocolate to create rivers of fudge, all wrapped up in our elegant butter cream.<\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Almond Delight Cake: White moist layers with a delicate, fresh roasted, ground almond filling. A truly elegant cake for an elegant occasion.<\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Lemon Twist Mellow: A hint of lemon and a divine creamy lemon filling. Wonderful with a raspberry filling.<\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Bella Matrimoniale Classic: Three moist layers of white cake with two fillings, almond and raspberry. Your Guests will say \u00e2\u20ac\u0153Wow\u00e2\u20ac\u009d and ask for seconds.<\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Cheese Cake Showstopper: Creamy New York cheesecake baked to perfection and frosted with our special butter cream or whipped cream.<\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Chocolate Passion Black Tie: Cake made with the finest imported dark chocolate filled with variety of berries.<\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Fillings: Vanilla, Chocolate, Raspberry, Strawberry, Fresh Sliced Strawberries, Peaches, Pineapples Roasted Almond<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Divine Cake Options.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762924\/width\/600\/height\/514\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Here are some BDW Bride's Cake Photos:<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Wedding Cake v2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762926\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Wedding Cake v3.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762928\/width\/340\/height\/510\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Wedding Cake.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762930\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1171995300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b4a00727e8747e56e44dbf593ce81a8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Details - &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;if you uncover some other random expenses or options, please PM or email me!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;The wedding canopy is 2 meters per side (approximately 6 ft x 6 ft)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Walkway can be red or white to Pergola&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;3 foot long sparklers $5 per sparkler.&amp;nbsp; Small metal ones $3\/6&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Projector for slideshow $300&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Welcome bag distribution $2-3 a bag&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;$40 for dress cleaning (after TTD session!)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;20 minutes from Playa Del Carmen, 15 minutes from Cancun&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Daily van from the resort takes you into town for $1 a person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Chair bows $5 each, if you bring your own there is a $1 iron fee&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;White tiffany chairs $9&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Brown tiffany chairs $7&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Fire dancers $1,000 a performance&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Excursion contact alex.orozco@yourcancundmc.com , her name is Alejandra&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Day Pass $55 per persona&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595159,"PostDate":1331759394,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Details - <\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">if you uncover some other random expenses or options, please PM or email me!<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">The wedding canopy is 2 meters per side (approximately 6 ft x 6 ft)<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Walkway can be red or white to Pergola<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">3 foot long sparklers $5 per sparkler.\u00a0 Small metal ones $3\/6<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Projector for slideshow $300<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Welcome bag distribution $2-3 a bag<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">$40 for dress cleaning (after TTD session!)<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">20 minutes from Playa Del Carmen, 15 minutes from Cancun<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Daily van from the resort takes you into town for $1 a person<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Chair bows $5 each, if you bring your own there is a $1 iron fee<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">White tiffany chairs $9<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Brown tiffany chairs $7<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Fire dancers $1,000 a performance<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Excursion contact alex.orozco@yourcancundmc.com , her name is Alejandra<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Day Pass $55 per persona<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1171995300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"