{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":75978,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that IzzyDeee mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78992-one-bridesmaid-driving-me-nuts-rant\/?view=findpost&p=1891167\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nI was going to ask if it's possible that she's recently pregnant and the long car rides will make her nauseous, but since your first event was over a year ago... Idk. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n-----------------------------\n\n\nNo she isn't pregnant. She is actually single atm (I realize this doesn't mean she isn't pregnant LOL) and has been single for almost a year so that's not it. @\"TNT2015\" She's also the type of person who couldn't keep that secret for very long so I would know by now haha! I'm starting to wonder if it is jealousy a bit on her part like was said before. I really hope it's not since I'm not the type to rub things in people's faces, so I'll feel badly if she feels like I am [emoji17]\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1426462827","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427619126,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73277,"Title":"liked a post you made in Cancun - Riviera Maya: Sele...","Message":"Hello!\n\nJenniferH114 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  @  We chose Excellence Riviera Cancun over EPM. EPM is beautiful and much more modern looking that ERC. The reason we chose ERC was for some of our guests, they are reserving 1 room for both parents and a 18-20 year old. While in both resorts the bathrooms are open to the bedrooms, EPM has...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78932-cancun-riviera-maya-selecting-venue-help-please\/?view=findpost&p=1889835\n","Sender":{"Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426692285,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73255,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"TNT2015,\n\nCaroV has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"ERC Price list\".\n\nCaroV said:\n======================================================================\nHi! Thank your for your help. Would you mind sending me the ERC price list to my email? It's carolinavalderrama@gmail.com\n\nThank you!\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=9052#msg16610\n","Sender":{"Id":282427,"Name":"CaroV","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426684287,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9052},{"Id":72519,"Title":"liked a post you made in Joann's Sale Ending Today","Message":"Hello!\n\nkimmyd2 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nJust an FYI for all the budget conscious brides on here. \n \nJoann's has all scrapbooking items 50% off through the 21st (this includes adhesives, stamps, ink, etc).\nThey also have a friends & family sale that ends today that gives you 25% off of your purchase in...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78904-joanns-sale-ending-today\/?view=findpost&p=1889301\n","Sender":{"Id":280238,"Name":"kimmyd2","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280238.png?_r=1412619945","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":60,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426466603,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":72172,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1889183\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"TNT2015\" We are! haha.. ya i'm a bit of an over planner and i'd probably say i'm well ahead of where I need to be. I feel like once you get going.. it's so hard to stop. I have just kept the momentum ever since I sent out the invites.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426257261,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":72170,"Title":"liked a post you made in Perianjay Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> We're close to the same date but you're a bit ahead of me in planning. I have the Save the Dates out and am waiting on my Invitations to come in the mail but thats it. You have so much good stuff in here. I love your mason jars!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1889181\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426257200,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":65266,"Title":"liked a post you made in Excellence Riviera Cancun B...","Message":"Hello!\n\nupstatekj just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nGot final confirmation on my date today! It feels so far away but I know it's going to come fast.\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/64583-excellence-riviera-cancun-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1885392\n","Sender":{"Id":277949,"Name":"upstatekj","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277949.jpg?_r=1405606592","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1423215679,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":65224,"Title":"liked a post you made in Excellence Riviera Cancun B...","Message":"Hello!\n\nJenniferH114 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nGot final confirmation on my date today! It feels so far away but I know it's going to come fast.\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/64583-excellence-riviera-cancun-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1885392\n","Sender":{"Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1423172213,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":64635,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"TNT2015,\n\nTammyWright has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Welcome TNT2015 to Best Destination Wedding\".\n\nTammyWright said:\n======================================================================\nHello TNT2015,\n\nWelcome to BestDestinationWedding.com (BDW). BDW is the Ultimate Resource for planning your destination wedding. We have over 70,000 registered bride, grooms and vendors.    \n\nHere are some links and tips that might make your time here on BDW more enjoyable.     \n\n  If you have not done so, you may want to:     \ncomplete your profile (upload a photo, add profile details, etc.)\nvisit the Newbies forum and introduce yourself  \nStart your own wedding planning blog  \nfind the forum for your wedding destination and create a subscription to threads\/members\/vendors that you are interested in\n \n  Here are some links that may be helpful to you:     \nDestination Wedding Community & Forum  \nResort Reviews  \nWedding Vendor Reviews  \nDestination Wedding Tips and Articles  \nWedding Image Gallery  \nBDW Help Page  \nBDW Forum Rules and Etiquette  \nHow to Download Attachments  \n \n  Here are some BDW members and staff you should follow:     \n\nModerators and Community Leaders     \nTammy Host - Founder and Owner of BDW  .  Tammy got married at Dreams Los Cabos in 2006\nAlexisinJamaica   - Moderator & Community Leader. Alexis got married in Jamaica in 2013.\n \nIf you would like to \"like\" or \"follow\" us, here are our BDW accounts:   \nBDW on Facebook   \nBDW on Twitter   \nBDW on Pinterest   \n \n  If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,   please email advertise@bestdestinationwedding.com .   \n\n Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!      \n\nPlease feel free to browse around and get to know others. If you have any questions please don't hesitate to ask. Hope you enjoy your time here.    \n\nTeam BDW    \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=8431#msg15294\n","Sender":{"Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1422836391,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":8431}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"9","TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
