{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":79767,"Title":"liked a post you made in 3 For 1 Kimonos At La Vie E...","Message":"Hello!\n\nkimmyd2 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nFor those canadian brides... not sure if they have this store in the states. They have 3 for 1 kimonos at la vie en Rose Boutique... so I got 3 kimonos for my bridesmaids for $40! They have pink&nave and Navy&blue. They are pretty cute actually!\n \nHappy planning!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79049-3-for-1-kimonos-at-la-vie-en-rose-boutique\/?view=findpost&p=1892822\n","Sender":{"Id":280238,"Name":"kimmyd2","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280238.png?_r=1412619945","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":60,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428962424,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79457,"Title":"liked a post you made in 3 For 1 Kimonos At La Vie E...","Message":"Hello!\n\nvancouverpetunia just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nFor those canadian brides... not sure if they have this store in the states. They have 3 for 1 kimonos at la vie en Rose Boutique... so I got 3 kimonos for my bridesmaids for $40! They have pink&nave and Navy&blue. They are pretty cute actually!\n \nHappy planning!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79049-3-for-1-kimonos-at-la-vie-en-rose-boutique\/?view=findpost&p=1892822\n","Sender":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428862922,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79448,"Title":"liked a post you made in 3 For 1 Kimonos At La Vie E...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"acw271011\" data-cid=\"1892857\" data-time=\"1428880379\">I'm online now and have my coupon. I can't find anything other than black and a white with pink. Navy would be awesome - are they the robes, kimono or cardigans? I'm not certain on black....\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79049-3-for-1-kimonos-at-la-vie-en-rose-boutique\/?view=findpost&p=1892860\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428860737,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79405,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Wafflesmom mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79049-3-for-1-kimonos-at-la-vie-en-rose-boutique\/?view=findpost&p=1892844\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"eriddell\" thanks so much! Saw your post and went to the mall before the sell out. I got the peach\/pink ones for my bridesmaids. I wanted the plain white satin kimono for myself but it wasn't on sale. The sales lady took pity on me and gave it to me for 40% off!! Woohoo, came out of there with 4 robes and saved about $107. Thank you so much, one more to check off my list.\n\nOh and my mom liked them so now I have yo go back and get the navy ones for the two moms.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428848594,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79404,"Title":"liked a post you made in 3 For 1 Kimonos At La Vie E...","Message":"Hello!\n\nWafflesmom just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nFor those canadian brides... not sure if they have this store in the states. They have 3 for 1 kimonos at la vie en Rose Boutique... so I got 3 kimonos for my bridesmaids for $40! They have pink&nave and Navy&blue. They are pretty cute actually!\n \nHappy planning!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79049-3-for-1-kimonos-at-la-vie-en-rose-boutique\/?view=findpost&p=1892822\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428848373,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78312,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"eriddell,\n\nDR2015 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"ID badges and lanyards!\".\n\nDR2015 said:\n======================================================================\nHello, were you still interested?\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9208&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":272393,"Name":"DR2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428512696,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9208},{"Id":76492,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"eriddell,\n\nDR2015 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"ID badges and lanyards!\".\n\nDR2015 said:\n======================================================================\nsorry the correct account is          cooper.tyshelle@gmail.com\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9208&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":272393,"Name":"DR2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427823117,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9208},{"Id":76491,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"eriddell,\n\nDR2015 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"ID badges and lanyards!\".\n\nDR2015 said:\n======================================================================\nhello the account email is coper.tyshelle@gmail.com- you would just go in and select send money to a friend.\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this person