have said they have tumblers and bags there as well! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hkorkovilis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401609292,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278186.jpg?_r=1417419505","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"helenk","Id":278186,"Name":"helenk","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.91.164.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a17bceff4d947869698929ec137036c5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"helenk\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;dollartree. dollardays. oriental trading, ebay amazon&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;oriental trading has good prices on tote bags. I use them for parties all the time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1859785,"PostDate":1405415818,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278186\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278186-helenk\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">helenk<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>dollartree. dollardays. oriental trading, ebay amazon<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>oriental trading has good prices on tote bags. I use them for parties all the time.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"noeljennifer1@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"12.52.150.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403600319,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278674.jpg?_r=1405114043","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennifernoel1","Id":278674,"Name":"jennifernoel1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.254.17.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3b8b42bb2d93e41792db9d622563c842","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"helenk\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"jennifernoel1\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good tips thanks!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Ok ladies who did u guys contact for group rates and incentives? I am working with a travel agent but from my understanding you set up you group rate agreement and incentives through the resort. But i called reservations they said i needed to call the WC. When i emailed Loreto (WC manager) He told me to contact hotel or TA because they don&#039;t handle group rates......so annoyed&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1859837,"PostDate":1405429721,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278186\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278186-helenk\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">helenk<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278674\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278674-jennifernoel1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jennifernoel1<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good tips thanks!!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ok ladies who did u guys contact for group rates and incentives? I am working with a travel agent but from my understanding you set up you group rate agreement and incentives through the resort. But i called reservations they said i needed to call the WC. When i emailed Loreto (WC manager) He told me to contact hotel or TA because they don't handle group rates......so annoyed<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kinamark2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.254.17.254","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404903430,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278927.jpg?_r=1406224733","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"budgetbride2015","Id":278927,"Name":"budgetbride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.174.145","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"171b5acffd9b9a26c1f1de63535acba7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My travel agent is handling the group booking\/rates for me! The resort itself doesn&#039;t do any room reservations, except for local Jamaicans. So once we secured the wedding date the TA turned me over to the wedding coordinator and stepped out of that part (unless I need her) and she went ahead with the group booking through Iberostar.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1859846,"PostDate":1405432674,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My travel agent is handling the group booking\/rates for me! The resort itself doesn't do any room reservations, except for local Jamaicans. So once we secured the wedding date the TA turned me over to the wedding coordinator and stepped out of that part (unless I need her) and she went ahead with the group booking through Iberostar.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403098087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.91.164.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e532a355642a184d93b140c511f92f07","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"budgetbride2015\"] only a travel agent can get the group rate for you. The hotel only deals with the local Jamaicans when it comes to reservations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And for group rates for the air-flights you have to contact the airline directly. And in order to get the discount 10 or more ppl must fly on the same flight at the same time coming and going.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1859847,"PostDate":1405432828,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278927\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278927-budgetbride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">budgetbride2015<\/span><\/a> only a travel agent can get the group rate for you. The hotel only deals with the local Jamaicans when it comes to reservations.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And for group rates for the air-flights you have to contact the airline directly. And in order to get the discount 10 or more ppl must fly on the same flight at the same time coming and going.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"noeljennifer1@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"12.52.150.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403600319,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278674.jpg?_r=1405114043","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennifernoel1","Id":278674,"Name":"jennifernoel1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.81.67","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"14eb7f444ee09cde9029dcc807c9e644","RawContent":"@mention @[member=\"jennifernoel1\"] thanks I spoke to my TA last night and she&#039;s going to take it from there","Attachments":[],"Id":1860104,"PostDate":1405500410,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @mention @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278674\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278674-jennifernoel1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jennifernoel1<\/span><\/a> thanks I spoke to my TA last night and she's going to take it from there\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kinamark2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.254.17.254","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404903430,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278927.jpg?_r=1406224733","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"budgetbride2015","Id":278927,"Name":"budgetbride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"70a0075dffba50d89e25290ebe1bc909","RawContent":"Yea I have a TA handling all of the travel as well, so happy I went that route! Imagine the headache trying to coordinate everyone&#039;s travel! I doubt I&#039;ll have 10+ people on the same flight but if there is I think my TA would try to get group rates for them. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1860141,"PostDate":1405511298,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yea I have a TA handling all of the travel as well, so happy I went that route! Imagine the headache trying to coordinate everyone's travel! I doubt I'll have 10+ people on the same flight but if there is I think my TA would try to get group rates for them. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hkorkovilis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401609292,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278186.jpg?_r=1417419505","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"helenk","Id":278186,"Name":"helenk","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.91.164.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,