Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.91.164.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ad81ba8a06d6edcbf8d307ced6811e47","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;You&#039;re more than welcome. I know we&#039;re all trying to save so whatever deals I find I&#039;ll post&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"helenk\"]&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1860447,"PostDate":1405605407,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>You're more than welcome. I know we're all trying to save so whatever deals I find I'll post<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278186\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278186-helenk\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">helenk<\/span><\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"noeljennifer1@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"12.52.150.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403600319,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278674.jpg?_r=1405114043","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennifernoel1","Id":278674,"Name":"jennifernoel1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.254.17.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1405692349,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"29e308b53695bef14c14f7edd7eb723f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This is what happens when you read to many posts in a day.....I almost switched my wedding location to the Royalton resort.... CRAZY ....It&#039;s so beautiful and its new (opened in 2013) but then i realized that 1. My fiance will leave me..lol! 2. It&#039;s so new that they don&#039;t have the experience our coordinators have 3. We know what we are getting because ppl have actually gotten married and shared their experience with us...with that said DON&#039;T read any reviews once you have your date booked ...lol! Ok i&#039;m back. :D&amp;nbsp; :D :D&amp;nbsp; :D&amp;nbsp; :D&amp;nbsp; :D  &lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;what packages did you guys decide on? At first i chose the cheapest package and then added on from there but the more expensive one turned out to be only $75 more once i added in everything (cocktail hour, steel band, etc) and that&#039;s all included with the highest package and you get a couples massage with it.....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Planning is starting to feel real now. My bridal reveal party is in 2weeks. I&#039;m going out to pick out items for them today (I have a party for everything ;)&amp;nbsp;) I&#039;m also having a logo designed to scan onto our OOT tote bags. I know its a little over 12 months away but I&#039;m in school, expecting and have a teen so it will be here before the new baby starts walking ..LOL!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1860726,"PostDate":1405692295,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is what happens when you read to many posts in a day.....I almost switched my wedding location to the Royalton resort.... CRAZY ....It's so beautiful and its new (opened in 2013) but then i realized that 1. My fiance will leave me..lol! 2. It's so new that they don't have the experience our coordinators have 3. We know what we are getting because ppl have actually gotten married and shared their experience with us...with that said DON'T read any reviews once you have your date booked ...lol! Ok i'm back. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<br><p>what packages did you guys decide on? At first i chose the cheapest package and then added on from there but the more expensive one turned out to be only $75 more once i added in everything (cocktail hour, steel band, etc) and that's all included with the highest package and you get a couples massage with it.....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning is starting to feel real now. My bridal reveal party is in 2weeks. I'm going out to pick out items for them today (I have a party for everything <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>\u00a0) I'm also having a logo designed to scan onto our OOT tote bags. I know its a little over 12 months away but I'm in school, expecting and have a teen so it will be here before the new baby starts walking ..LOL!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kinamark2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.254.17.254","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404903430,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278927.jpg?_r=1406224733","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"budgetbride2015","Id":278927,"Name":"budgetbride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.120.132","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"db5c8d8ae8719cc538794b78820205da","RawContent":"@[member=\"budgetbride2015\"] wow you have a lot going on! Where are you getting the logo done to put onto your bag? I am trying to see what the cheapest option is. I read a review online where a girl got a design from online and ironed it onto the bag. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1860728,"PostDate":1405693825,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278927\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278927-budgetbride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">budgetbride2015<\/span><\/a> wow you have a lot going on! Where are you getting the logo done to put onto your bag? I am trying to see what the cheapest option is. I read a review online where a girl got a design from online and ironed it onto the bag. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hkorkovilis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401609292,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278186.jpg?_r=1417419505","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"helenk","Id":278186,"Name":"helenk","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.81.99","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf1c64fb5df437b2605dbb7730eb177c","RawContent":"@[member=\"helenk\"] too much. This is why men are not included in the planning process.  I asked my FI to ask his friend how much he charges to design a logo. He instead told him what we wanted, gave him all the info... his friend started working on it and when I inquired about the price that&#039;s when he asked him..so $75 ... I could of gotten my sister to do for free....not as nice of course but within my budget....Lol\n\n[quote name=\"helenk\" post=\"1860728\" timestamp=\"1405711825\"]\n@[member=\"budgetbride2015\"] wow you have a lot going on! Where are you getting the logo done to put onto your bag? I am trying to see what the cheapest option is. I read a review online where a girl got a design from online and ironed it onto the bag. \nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1860762,"PostDate":1405703801,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278186\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278186-helenk\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">helenk<\/span><\/a> too much. This is why men are not included in the planning process.  I asked my FI to ask his friend how much he charges to design a logo. He instead told him what we wanted, gave him all the info... his friend started working on it and when I inquired about the price that's when he asked him..so $75 ... I could of gotten my sister to do for free....not as nice of course but within my budget....Lol<br><br><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>helenk, on 18 July 2014 - 02:30 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278927\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278927-budgetbride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">budgetbride2015<\/span><\/a> wow you have a lot going on! Where are you getting the logo done to put onto your bag? I am trying to see what the cheapest option is. I read a review online where a girl got a design from online and ironed it onto the bag. <br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p><\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kinamark2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.254.17.254","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404903430,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278927.jpg?_r=1406224733","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"budgetbride2015","Id":278927,"Name":"budgetbride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.91.164.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f212fc1fb352591521e0e4841ee19d4d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@BUDGETBRIDE205 @[member=\"helenk\"] THERE&#039;S ALOT OF FREE TEMPLATES ON HERE. I &amp;nbsp;HAVE SEEN LOGO&#039;S MONOGRAMS WATER BOTTLE LABLES PROGRAMS AND SO MUCH MORE. NO NEED TO PAY FOR EXTRA STUFF IF YOU&#039;RE ALREADY PAYING FOR THE WEDDING IN MY OPINION.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;HEY LADIES,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have any of you tried to make payments towards your wedding. I wanted to be payed off by December but Loreto suggested that I don&#039;t start sending &amp;nbsp;any funding in 2015 due to accounting purposes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I went with the middle packaged but will be going up to the highest package and depending on the guest amount a private dinner. @[member=\"budgetbride2015\"]&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1861205,"PostDate":1405930918,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@BUDGETBRIDE205 @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278186\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278186-helenk\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">helenk<\/span><\/a> THERE'S ALOT OF FREE TEMPLATES ON HERE. I \u00a0HAVE SEEN LOGO'S MONOGRAMS WATER BOTTLE LABLES PROGRAMS AND SO MUCH MORE. NO NEED TO PAY FOR EXTRA STUFF IF YOU'RE ALREADY PAYING FOR THE WEDDING IN MY OPINION.\u00a0<\/p><br \/><p>HEY LADIES,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have any of you tried to make payments towards your wedding. I wanted to be payed off by December but Loreto suggested that I don't start sending \u00a0any funding in 2015 due to accounting purposes.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I went with the middle packaged but will be going up to the highest package and depending on the guest amount a private dinner. @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278927\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278927-budgetbride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">budgetbride2015<\/span><\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"noeljennifer1@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"12.52.150.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403600319,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278674.jpg?_r=1405114043","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennifernoel1","Id":278674,"Name":"jennifernoel1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3be983d3c5c5ff0b2f2c2bc3079c39a9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"jennifernoel1\" post=\"1861205\" timestamp=\"1405948918\"]\n@BUDGETBRIDE205 @[member=\"helenk\"] THERE&#039;S ALOT OF FREE TEMPLATES ON HERE. I  HAVE SEEN LOGO&#039;S MONOGRAMS WATER BOTTLE LABLES PROGRAMS AND SO MUCH MORE. NO NEED TO PAY FOR EXTRA STUFF IF YOU&#039;RE ALREADY PAYING FOR THE WEDDING IN MY OPINION. \n\nHEY LADIES,\n\nHave any of you tried to make payments towards your wedding. I wanted to be payed off by December but Loreto suggested that I don&#039;t start sending  any funding in 2015 due to accounting purposes. \n\n\nI went with the middle packaged but will be going up to the highest package and depending on the guest amount a private dinner. @[member=\"budgetbride2015\"][\/quote]\n\nI haven&#039;t made any payments just the initial deposit. We are still saving. I would just put all the wedding money in one account and when it comes time to pay just make one lump payment if that works for you. I&#039;m going to open a savings account just for the wedding fund. I am doing the gold package as well. I&#039;m waiting to get a final guest count to decide if I want to pay extra for a private reception. I figure if we have enough people the semi private will feel private anyway since we will be taking up most of the restaurant, lol. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1861207,"PostDate":1405931391,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jennifernoel1, on 21 July 2014 - 08:21 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@BUDGETBRIDE205 @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278186\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278186-helenk\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">helenk<\/span><\/a> THERE'S ALOT OF FREE TEMPLATES ON HERE. I  HAVE SEEN LOGO'S MONOGRAMS WATER BOTTLE LABLES PROGRAMS AND SO MUCH MORE. NO NEED TO PAY FOR EXTRA STUFF IF YOU'RE ALREADY PAYING FOR THE WEDDING IN MY OPINION. <br><br>\nHEY LADIES,<br><br>\nHave any of you tried to make payments towards your wedding. I wanted to be payed off by December but Loreto suggested that I don't start sending  any funding in 2015 due to accounting purposes. <br><br><br>\nI went with the middle packaged but will be going up to the highest package and depending on the guest amount a private dinner. @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278927\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278927-budgetbride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">budgetbride2015<\/span><\/a><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><br><br>\nI haven't made any payments just the initial deposit. We are still saving. I would just put all the wedding money in one account and when it comes time to pay just make one lump payment if that works for you. I'm going to open a savings account just for the wedding fund. I am doing the gold package as well. I'm waiting to get a final guest count to decide if I want to pay extra for a private reception. I figure if we have enough people the semi private will feel private anyway since we will be taking up most of the restaurant, lol. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hkorkovilis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401609292,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278186.jpg?_r=1417419505","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"helenk","Id":278186,"Name":"helenk","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.254.17.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b4b51030c470a7ce704c56b5b146b6b5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"jennifernoel1\"] @[member=\"helenk\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I haven&#039;t started making payments yet. From my understanding you can pay towards it in advance but i would hold off only because you might be able to do somethings without actully paying for it (like a free cocktail party, or welcome party) depending on your guest count and what the WCs suggest. I know i&#039;ve read where brides hosted a meet and greet at the music bar for free instead of paying for a private set up&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also check to see if you can put all the money on a card that doesn&#039;t charge an international fee. When i made the deposit i was charged $7\/$12 for the deposit. If the wedding is going to cost me over 4grand i don&#039;t even want to know the fee my bank will charge&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1861250,"PostDate":1405943260,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278674\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278674-jennifernoel1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jennifernoel1<\/span><\/a> @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278186\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278186-helenk\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">helenk<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I haven't started making payments yet. From my understanding you can pay towards it in advance but i would hold off only because you might be able to do somethings without actully paying for it (like a free cocktail party, or welcome party) depending on your guest count and what the WCs suggest. I know i've read where brides hosted a meet and greet at the music bar for free instead of paying for a private set up<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also check to see if you can put all the money on a card that doesn't charge an international fee. When i made the deposit i was charged $7\/$12 for the deposit. If the wedding is going to cost me over 4grand i don't even want to know the fee my bank will charge<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kinamark2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.254.17.254","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404903430,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278927.jpg?_r=1406224733","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"budgetbride2015","Id":278927,"Name":"budgetbride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a284820f531184a6470d6630e88d6ebf","RawContent":"@[member=\"budgetbride2015\"]  oh that&#039;s weird I didn&#039;t get any weird charges when I paid my deposit via debit card. Yea I&#039;m def waiting until like right before to pay for everything so I don&#039;t pay for stuff we don&#039;t end up needing or using. \n@[member=\"budgetbride2015\"] I also read about the free welcome party. I plan to ask the WC about that when we start communicating directly with her :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1861329,"PostDate":1405963003,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278927\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278927-budgetbride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">budgetbride2015<\/span><\/a>  oh that's weird I didn't get any weird charges when I paid my deposit via debit card. Yea I'm def waiting until like right before to pay for everything so I don't pay for stuff we don't end up needing or using. <br \/>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278927\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278927-budgetbride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">budgetbride2015<\/span><\/a> I also read about the free welcome party. I plan to ask the WC about that when we start communicating directly with her <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hkorkovilis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401609292,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278186.jpg?_r=1417419505","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"helenk","Id":278186,"Name":"helenk","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.91.164.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"23b8ede0635d55f42909fe6a857f0ef5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Now he says he talked to accounting and I can.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Yes, I have ready that ppl have had welcome parties by the bar, Nothing that was actually setup by the hotel. From my understand if its coordinated with the hotel there will be a fee involved.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"budgetbride2015\"] @[member=\"helenk\"]&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1861555,"PostDate":1406038361,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Now he says he talked to accounting and I can.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Yes, I have ready that ppl have had welcome parties by the bar, Nothing that was actually setup by the hotel. From my understand if its coordinated with the hotel there will be a fee involved.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278927\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278927-budgetbride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">budgetbride2015<\/span><\/a> @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278186\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278186-helenk\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">helenk<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"noeljennifer1@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"12.52.150.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403600319,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278674.jpg?_r=1405114043","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennifernoel1","Id":278674,"Name":"jennifernoel1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.81.13","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1406052764,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cc70adb55ba64bbda9be078844253558","RawContent":"@[member=\"jennifernoel1\"] pretty much....I was going to do a beach welcome party with a national bar for 2 hours but definitely going the free music bar route if we can. ....I believe it&#039;s offered when the bar is usually closed and they pull a bartender to serve your guests\n\n\nAlso I&#039;m trying to decide if I should just have everyone book on their own through the travel agent or get a room block. .....with the room block we would have to pay the deposit upfront for the rooms any thoughts @[member=\"helenk\"] @[member=\"jennifernoel1\"]","Attachments":[],"Id":1861634,"PostDate":1406052726,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278674\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278674-jennifernoel1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jennifernoel1<\/span><\/a> pretty much....I was going to do a beach welcome party with a national bar for 2 hours but definitely going the free music bar route if we can. ....I believe it's offered when the bar is usually closed and they pull a bartender to serve your guests<br><br>\nAlso I'm trying to decide if I should just have everyone book on their own through the travel agent or get a room block. .....with the room block we would have to pay the deposit upfront for the rooms any thoughts @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278186\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278186-helenk\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">helenk<\/span><\/a> @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278674\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278674-jennifernoel1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jennifernoel1<\/span><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kinamark2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.254.17.254","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404903430,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278927.jpg?_r=1406224733","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"budgetbride2015","Id":278927,"Name":"budgetbride2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":122,"TotalPages":13,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":120},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
