Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39bde81265bf62352d49b1cdee8529d9","RawContent":"@[member=\"jennifernoel1\"]  Yes it&#039;s def stressful to try to accommodate everyone! I already can&#039;t wait for all this planning to be over. I&#039;m just ready to be in Jamaica already! Lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1862272,"PostDate":1406284834,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278674\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278674-jennifernoel1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jennifernoel1<\/span><\/a>  Yes it's def stressful to try to accommodate everyone! I already can't wait for all this planning to be over. I'm just ready to be in Jamaica already! Lol \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hkorkovilis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401609292,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278186.jpg?_r=1417419505","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"helenk","Id":278186,"Name":"helenk","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.254.17.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a99a68e5751a283213fcea53ee07746a","RawContent":"@[member=\"jennifernoel1\"] that&#039;s actually not bad i thought i would have been higher...how many rooms did you block?\n[quote name=\"jennifernoel1\" post=\"1862220\" timestamp=\"1406293031\"]\n@[member=\"helenk\"] @[member=\"FutureMrsGlover\"] @[member=\"budgetbride2015\"]\n\nYea, i understand as it cost $1000 to block the rooms. But I called all my friends that I knew could pay their deposit and send them the TA info. The prices have already gone up by $55 I don&#039;t want to risk it being any higher. I&#039;m trying to keep my guest under $800[\/quote]You should be able to keep it under $800 esp if most of your guests are flying from Florida (flights are usually pretty reasonable to JA) how long are most of your guests staying for?","Attachments":[],"Id":1862366,"PostDate":1406300734,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278674\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278674-jennifernoel1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jennifernoel1<\/span><\/a> that's actually not bad i thought i would have been higher...how many rooms did you block?<\/p>\n<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jennifernoel1, on 25 July 2014 - 07:57 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278186\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278186-helenk\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">helenk<\/span><\/a> @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277534\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277534-futuremrsglover\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">FutureMrsGlover<\/span><\/a> @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278927\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278927-budgetbride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">budgetbride2015<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Yea, i understand as it cost $1000 to block the rooms. But I called all my friends that I knew could pay their deposit and send them the TA info. The prices have already gone up by $55 I don't want to risk it being any higher. I'm trying to keep my guest under $800<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>You should be able to keep it under $800 esp if most of your guests are flying from Florida (flights are usually pretty reasonable to JA) how long are most of your guests staying for?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kinamark2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.254.17.254","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404903430,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278927.jpg?_r=1406224733","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"budgetbride2015","Id":278927,"Name":"budgetbride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.167.5.214","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e2e21f256c8855b80d14c0a8646c8d01","RawContent":"I&#039;m completely confused on the \"room block.\" I&#039;m using a travel agent but she never mentioned a room block - she is just taking $150 deposits per person to reserve the room and she said prices won&#039;t change (but could go down, or they will also price match a sale price on any travel site).\n\nNow I&#039;m wondering if I should double verify with her on the prices. Our wedding isn&#039;t until June and I definitely don&#039;t want people paying more. \n\n[quote name=\"jennifernoel1\" post=\"1862220\" timestamp=\"1406293031\"]\n@[member=\"helenk\"] @[member=\"FutureMrsGlover\"] @[member=\"budgetbride2015\"]\n\nYea, i understand as it cost $1000 to block the rooms. But I called all my friends that I knew could pay their deposit and send them the TA info. The prices have already gone up by $55 I don&#039;t want to risk it being any higher. I&#039;m trying to keep my guest under $800[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1862619,"PostDate":1406467531,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm completely confused on the \"room block.\" I'm using a travel agent but she never mentioned a room block - she is just taking $150 deposits per person to reserve the room and she said prices won't change (but could go down, or they will also price match a sale price on any travel site).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Now I'm wondering if I should double verify with her on the prices. Our wedding isn't until June and I definitely don't want people paying more.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jennifernoel1, on 25 July 2014 - 07:57 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278186\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278186-helenk\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">helenk<\/span><\/a> @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277534\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277534-futuremrsglover\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">FutureMrsGlover<\/span><\/a> @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278927\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278927-budgetbride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">budgetbride2015<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Yea, i understand as it cost $1000 to block the rooms. But I called all my friends that I knew could pay their deposit and send them the TA info. The prices have already gone up by $55 I don't want to risk it being any higher. I'm trying to keep my guest under $800<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403098087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.91.164.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1406549349,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e53c839eea617f20e767f12530c5bc7f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(247,247,247);\"&gt;@&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_member\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278186-helenk\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;helenk&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(247,247,247);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;@&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_member\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277534-futuremrsglover\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;FutureMrsGlover&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(247,247,247);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;@&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(68,112,140);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(247,247,247);\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_member\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278927-budgetbride2015\/\" title=\"\"&gt;budgetbride2015&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"beckys98\"]&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(68,112,140);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(247,247,247);\"&gt;I have contacted several agents and they have all pretty much said the same thing. Some don&#039;t recommend a room block because if the prices go down you may not get the discounted rate (but that all depends on whatever specials are going on at the time). &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(68,112,140);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(247,247,247);\"&gt;However because I have stayed at this hotel before and there&#039;s a wedding the day after mine I don&#039;t want to risk my guest paying a higher price because I know it can get sold out.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My guest shouldn&#039;t be paying any more than $700-800. Air fare from Florida is around $221-268. Our deposit is only $50 per person.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"budgetbride2015\"] I blocked 10 rooms. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1862794,"PostDate":1406549167,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">@<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278186-helenk\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>helenk<\/span><\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">\u00a0@<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277534-futuremrsglover\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>FutureMrsGlover<\/span><\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">\u00a0@<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(68,112,140);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278927-budgetbride2015\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>budgetbride2015<\/a>\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278581\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278581-beckys98\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">beckys98<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(68,112,140);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">I have contacted several agents and they have all pretty much said the same thing. Some don't recommend a room block because if the prices go down you may not get the discounted rate (but that all depends on whatever specials are going on at the time). <\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(68,112,140);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">However because I have stayed at this hotel before and there's a wedding the day after mine I don't want to risk my guest paying a higher price because I know it can get sold out.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My guest shouldn't be paying any more than $700-800. Air fare from Florida is around $221-268. Our deposit is only $50 per person.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278927\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278927-budgetbride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">budgetbride2015<\/span><\/a> I blocked 10 rooms. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"noeljennifer1@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"12.52.150.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403600319,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278674.jpg?_r=1405114043","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennifernoel1","Id":278674,"Name":"jennifernoel1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.80.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"85668a50dc4ea8961529ead2ad866d9e","RawContent":"@[member=\"jennifernoel1\"] that&#039;s not bad at all thanks something to think about. My wedding is in august I don&#039;t think we&#039;ll have that issue with the rooms selling out but I could be wrong","Attachments":[],"Id":1862888,"PostDate":1406570546,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278674\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278674-jennifernoel1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jennifernoel1<\/span><\/a> that's not bad at all thanks something to think about. My wedding is in august I don't think we'll have that issue with the rooms selling out but I could be wrong \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kinamark2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.254.17.254","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404903430,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278927.jpg?_r=1406224733","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"budgetbride2015","Id":278927,"Name":"budgetbride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"35b1b3a11b7c048fe5191be1340d03f1","RawContent":"@[member=\"jennifernoel1\"]\n\nDid you block the rooms through your TA? Is the $1000 the price for 10 rooms ? I&#039;m wondering if I should block the rooms now....","Attachments":[],"Id":1862889,"PostDate":1406571753,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278674\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278674-jennifernoel1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jennifernoel1<\/span><\/a><br>\nDid you block the rooms through your TA? Is the $1000 the price for 10 rooms ? I'm wondering if I should block the rooms now....\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hkorkovilis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401609292,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278186.jpg?_r=1417419505","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"helenk","Id":278186,"Name":"helenk","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.91.164.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ad3115697cba55bce376f043a2ab17df","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"budgetbride2015\"] @[member=\"helenk\"] the hotel requires that you block ten rooms. Yes, the agent blocked the ten rooms for me.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What I did was send out my wedding website to all of my friend and famil. The &amp;nbsp;site has the deposit information and &amp;nbsp;the room prices as of now. I advised them to pay their deposit so that they can lock in this rate.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Per the agent, if the price drops and its not for new customers we&#039;ll be able to obtain the discount. However if the lower rate is for new customers only we wont be able to get the lower price.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I choose this agent because out of all the agents i sent an email to she was the fastest to respond and she had a lower deposit than everyone else.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1862976,"PostDate":1406620387,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278927\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278927-budgetbride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">budgetbride2015<\/span><\/a> @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278186\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278186-helenk\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">helenk<\/span><\/a> the hotel requires that you block ten rooms. Yes, the agent blocked the ten rooms for me.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What I did was send out my wedding website to all of my friend and famil. The \u00a0site has the deposit information and \u00a0the room prices as of now. I advised them to pay their deposit so that they can lock in this rate.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Per the agent, if the price drops and its not for new customers we'll be able to obtain the discount. However if the lower rate is for new customers only we wont be able to get the lower price.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I choose this agent because out of all the agents i sent an email to she was the fastest to respond and she had a lower deposit than everyone else.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"noeljennifer1@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"12.52.150.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403600319,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278674.jpg?_r=1405114043","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennifernoel1","Id":278674,"Name":"jennifernoel1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.254.17.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f2a3870f9886098af3057e48d85cba60","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"jennifernoel1\"] do you mind if i ask the rates you were given? I&#039;m still waiting for my travel agent to get back to me which sucks because i wanted to have this info before this weekend so i can at least give it to my bridal party and close relatives&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1863079,"PostDate":1406643210,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278674\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278674-jennifernoel1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jennifernoel1<\/span><\/a> do you mind if i ask the rates you were given? I'm still waiting for my travel agent to get back to me which sucks because i wanted to have this info before this weekend so i can at least give it to my bridal party and close relatives<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kinamark2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.254.17.254","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404903430,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278927.jpg?_r=1406224733","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"budgetbride2015","Id":278927,"Name":"budgetbride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.254.17.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"45f465042f6a9062bb7461d0d3e27ab2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey ladies!!!! If you haven&#039;t already check out these threads...These ladies got married back in 2011 but has done an amazing job at DIY projects and have really cool ideas and ways to save money but still a have a fabulous wedding&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;search for ...Mrstgun&#039;s &amp;amp; torilynnsmith&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I already have a few ideas i took from them. Since i&#039;m so early but really don&#039;t want to wait till the last minute i think i&#039;m going to start with making 30 of everything and then as people book add on. My family keeps joking that i might be having twins that one&#039;s hiding (NOT FUNNY) but if that&#039;s the case I won&#039;t have time to do anything (unless i clone myself)....LOL!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1863105,"PostDate":1406647960,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey ladies!!!! If you haven't already check out these threads...These ladies got married back in 2011 but has done an amazing job at DIY projects and have really cool ideas and ways to save money but still a have a fabulous wedding<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>search for ...Mrstgun's & torilynnsmith<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I already have a few ideas i took from them. Since i'm so early but really don't want to wait till the last minute i think i'm going to start with making 30 of everything and then as people book add on. My family keeps joking that i might be having twins that one's hiding (NOT FUNNY) but if that's the case I won't have time to do anything (unless i clone myself)....LOL!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kinamark2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.254.17.254","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404903430,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278927.jpg?_r=1406224733","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"budgetbride2015","Id":278927,"Name":"budgetbride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.91.164.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75612,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1406707516,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"44daad8af63e29172ae031b538c83a76","RawContent":"&lt;div&gt;ROSE HALL SUITES: &amp;nbsp;Room Category Occupancy Number of&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Standard Single 3 $792.00&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;3 Nights Price Per Person&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Double 3 $564.00&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Triple 3 $519.00&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Quad 3 $495.00&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Children 3-12 3 $147.00&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Children 0-2 3 $20.00&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Room Category Occupancy Number of&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Standard Single 4 $1,056.00&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;4 Nights Price Per Person&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Double 4 $752.00&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Triple 4 $692.00&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Quad 4 $660.00&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;